RADAR_LOAD("2026-11",[{"id":"10.1021/acsapm.6c04260","t":"Nanoscale ZnO Coatings on Poly(methyl methacrylate) Submicron Spheres via Low-Temperature Atomic Layer Deposition for Enhanced UV-Blocking Properties","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsapm.6c04260","s":"ACS Applied Polymer Materials","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Poly(methyl methacrylate) (PMMA), a synthetic thermoplastic polymer, has been extensively used in our lives due to its advantageous properties such as high transparency, lightweight, and biocompatibility. Although PMMA exhibits great potential in sunscreens, its poor UV-blocking properties hinder its practical applications. In this study, we modified the PMMA submicron spheres (120–150 nm) with nanoscale ZnO using atomic layer deposition (ALD) in a fluidized bed reactor at a low temperature of 40 °C, with diethylzinc (DEZ) and water as precursors. We systematically investigated the ZnO-coated PMMA microspheres using FTIR, XRD, SEM, TEM, XPS, and TG to elucidate the mechanism of nucleation and growth of ZnO. The results revealed that the ZnO deposited was polycrystalline, displaying a granular morphology on the PMMA surfaces. Specifically, a nanoparticle-coated structure was obse","au":["Guanghui Yan","Zhijian Lv","Yi Ouyang","Guoxiang Chen","Zehua Jin","Lu Jin"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zb":"利用原子层沉积在40 °C低温下对PMMA亚微米球进行纳米级ZnO涂层，研究ZnO的成核与生长机制。结果显示ZnO呈多晶颗粒状，在低循环ALD下形成纳米粒子涂层，高循环ALD下形成连续纳米薄膜。涂覆后PMMA在280–400 nm紫外区的反射率从约95%降至19%，平均可见光反射率保持在93%以上。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ra07025f","t":"Ultrasound-driven nitrogen oxidation: a sonoelectrochemical pathway to ammonia synthesis boosted by contact-electro-catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra07025f","s":"RSC Advances","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A new method was developed for green ammonia production by integrating ultrasound-assisted nitrogen activation and electrochemical NO x reduction to NH 3 .","au":["Arash Toghraei","Daniel Guay"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"开发了一种通过超声辅助氮活化与电化学NOx还原制氨的新方法，利用接触电催化机制提升氨合成效率。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/w18222814","t":"Catalyst Engineering for Urea-Assisted Water Splitting: Bridging Energy and Remediation","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/w18222814","s":"Water","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrocatalytic water splitting (EWS) offers a sustainable route for green hydrogen (H2) generation; however, the anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER) suffers from sluggish kinetics and high thermodynamic overpotential, severely hindering overall system efficiency. Replacing the traditional OER with the urea oxidation reaction (UOR) offers a highly attractive alternative, as it lowers the cell voltage needed for hydrogen evolution and can contribute to the treatment of urea-containing wastewater, provided that urea is converted selectively to N2. This review comprehensively examines recent advances in electrocatalytic materials for urea-assisted water splitting (UAWS). It highlights key catalyst engineering strategies, including compositional tuning, heteroatom doping, and modification of structural and morphological, phase and interface properties, electronic conductivity, and durabi","au":["Md Ahasan Habib"],"o":"日常","zt":"尿素辅助水分解的催化剂工程：连接能源与修复","zb":"该综述探讨了尿素辅助水分解（UAWS）以替代传统的析氧反应（OER），旨在降低产氢电压并处理含尿素废水。文章评估了催化剂工程策略，包括组分调控、掺杂和结构修饰，并对比了四种标准，为设计高性能、低成本且可扩展的资源正性能源系统提供指导。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adem.71392","t":"Adjusting Nucleation Chemistry for the Atomic Layer Deposition of Antimony Selenide on Metal Oxide Surfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adem.71392","s":"Advanced Engineering Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Mixed antimony chalcogenides (Sb 2 E 3 , E = S, Se) as solar light absorbers offer bandgap tunability with favorable optical and electrical properties. However, depositing continuous films of thickness adjusted to the high optical absorption coefficients (<100 nm) has been challenging due to the favored formation of crystalline needles. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) as an ideally conformal deposition method is suited to addressing this challenge, but in the case of Sb 2 Se 3 , nucleation chemistry effects can render the substrate inert. Using tris(dimethylamido)antimony (Sb(NMe 2 ) 3 ) and bis(trimethylsilyl)selenide ((Me 3 Si) 2 Se) as precursors, we demonstrate that undesirable silylation of surface hydroxyl groups can be minimized by a pretreatment with Sb(NMe 2 ) 3 . The near‐saturation of nucleation sites on a metal oxide surface is demonstrated by scanning transmission electron mic","au":["Pei‐Chun Liao","Klaus Götz","Johannes Will","Mingjan Wu","Martin Dierner","Patrick Duchstein"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"调整金属氧化物表面锑化硒原子层沉积的成核化学","zb":"利用三(二甲氨基)锑预处理金属氧化物表面，最小化表面羟基的 undesirable 硅化，实现了锑化硒原子层沉积的近饱和成核位点。密度泛函理论揭示了表面抑制和再活化的热力学重要性。该方法制备了光滑、连续的超薄(<50 nm)锑化硒薄膜，并成功应用于功能太阳能电池。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c03968","t":"Hydrometallogel-Templated, Plasmonic Au Nanoparticle Assemblies for NIR-Activated H2 Release from Ammonia-Borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c03968","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The addition of [Au(acac)(PMe3)] (acac = acetylacetonate) to orotic acid affords the mononuclear complex [Au(N-orotate)(PMe3)] (1) and the dinuclear species [{Au(PMe3)}2(μ-O,N-orotate)] (2), with the crystal structures of two polymorphs of complex 2 fully elucidated by X-ray diffraction studies. Remarkably, complex 1 undergoes ultrasound-induced supramolecular self-assembly in water to form a robust Au(I) hydrometallogel (1-hyd), whereas 2 lacks the capacity to gelate due to coordination-induced suppression of intermolecular hydrogen bonding. The hydrometallogel acts as both a soft template and an in situ gold precursor, enabling the formation of densely packed, belt-like assemblies of plasmonic Au nanoparticles (1-hyd-Au NPs) upon mild and short thermal treatment. These anisotropic nanoarrays display strong interparticle coupling, yielding a broad, red-shifted localized surface","au":["Ainhoa Rodríguez-Gobernado","Daniel Blasco","Sonia Moreno","Hippolyte Amaveda","Mario Mora","M. Elena Olmos"],"o":"日常","zt":"水金属凝胶模板化、等离激元金纳米粒子组装用于氨硼烷近红外激活释氢","zb":"超声诱导金(I)水金属凝胶自组装形成软模板和金前驱体，经热处理生成密集排列的带状等离激元金纳米粒子组装体。该组装体在808 nm激发下表现出高效光热转换和局域表面等离激元共振吸收。利用此双激活模式，组装体催化氨硼烷甲醇解，显著增强释氢效率。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78759","t":"Stabilization of Strongly Reduced Fe(I) Single Atom Species Coordinated in a 2D Self‐Assembled Metal–Organic Network","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78759","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"A graphene-supported 2D metal–organic network stabilizes highly reactive Fe(I)-N 4 single sites through Co-induced charge redistribution. Combined experiments and theory reveal Fe(I) formation, oxygen-driven oxidation, and O 2 activation mechanisms, offering a strategy to access low-valent iron centers relevant to catalytic and biological processes. ABSTRACT Stabilization of low-valent iron centers in atomically defined coordination environments remains a major challenge in the design of reactive metal–organic materials. Here, we report the rational stabilization of Fe(I)-N 4 single sites in a graphene-supported, two-dimensional metal–organic network assembled from FeTPyP tectons and Co coordination nodes. We find that nitrogen tetra-coordination in this specific bidimensional metal–organic network allows the stabilization of iron in the +1 oxidation state. Using state-of-the-art experim","au":["Alessandro Namar","Basant Roondhe","Michela De Col","Stefania Baronio","Matteo Jugovac","Mattia Scardamaglia"],"o":"日常","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zb":"在石墨烯支撑的二维金属有机网络中稳定了高反应性的Fe(I)-N4单原子位点，Co配位诱导电荷重分布将卟啉铁中心还原为Fe(I)。实验与理论结合揭示了Fe(I)的形成、氧驱动氧化及O2活化机制，表明该策略在生物合成氨等关键反应中具有潜在应用价值。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.9224223","t":"Sustainable Electrosynthesis of Hexamethylenetetramine via Paired Electrolysis of Nitrate and PET Waste","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.9224223","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"First electrocatalytic synthesis of hexamethylenetetramine (HMTA) via paired electrolysis: A bifunctional Fe–Ni 2 P catalyst concurrently reduces nitrate to ammonia (∼96.0% FE) and oxidizes ethylene glycol to formaldehyde intermediates, coupling them into HMTA with ∼75.2% carbon selectivity. ABSTRACT Hexamethylenetetramine (HMTA) is a critical organonitrogen compound widely used in the defense, pharmaceutical, and polymer industries. Conventional HMTA production relies on toxic formaldehyde (HCHO) and energy-intensive Haber–Bosch-derived ammonia (NH 3 ) as feedstocks. This study demonstrates a sustainable electrocatalytic approach for the direct synthesis of HMTA via paired electrolysis, using nitrate (NO 3 − ) and polyethylene terephthalate (PET) waste as nitrogen and carbon sources, respectively. With iron-doped nickel phosphide (Fe–Ni 2 P) as a bifunctional catalyst, the system achiev","au":["Jingtao Zhou","Jiu Chen","Rui Shi","Zhengxiao Guo","Edmund C. M. Tse","Fulai Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zb":"利用Fe掺杂Ni2P双功能催化剂，通过硝酸盐和PET废料的配对电解直接合成六亚甲基四胺。阴极将硝酸盐还原为氨（约96.0%法拉第效率），阳极将PET衍生的乙二醇氧化为甲醛中间体，两者偶联生成HMTA（约75.2%碳选择性）。Fe掺杂诱导电荷重分布，降低了*HCHO中间体形成的能垒。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6qi01755j","t":"Cu–Co electronic synergy in Cu-doped CoCO3 enabling high-performance electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6qi01755j","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Frontiers","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T04:37:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3–RR) has emerged as a promising strategy for green ammonia synthesis. However, developing robust catalysts with high activity and selectivity remains a significant challenge. Here,...","au":["Ning Wang","Qian Wang","Zhongcan Wang","Mingqi Zhang","Shipeng Wu","Qinghu Tang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu–Co 电子协同效应在 Cu 掺杂 CoCO3 中实现高性能电催化硝酸根还原制氨","zb":"Cu 掺杂 CoCO3 利用了 Cu–Co 电子协同效应，实现了电催化硝酸根还原反应的高活性与高选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78831","t":"Tandem Catalysis Sites in Co‐NO/C for Efficient and Scalable Electrocatalytic Nitrate to Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78831","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work reports a Co-NO/C catalyst featuring Co 3 O 4 and Co 4 N sites that synergistically activate nitrate for electrocatalytic reduction to ammonia (NH 3 ). Co 3 O 4 sites adsorb and activate NO 3 − , while Co 4 N sites provide active hydrogen (H * ). The system achieves high NH 3 selectivity and efficiency, demonstrating scalable nitrate remediation and ammonia recovery in a Zn–NO 3 − battery and MEA reactor. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (eNO 3 RA) represents an emerging strategy for coupling nitrate remediation with nitrogen recovery and value-added ammonia production, but it remains challenging to simultaneously promote nitrate activation and downstream hydrogenation. Herein, we report a Co -NO/C catalyst featuring Co 3 O 4 /Co 4 N tandem catalysis sites embedded in a conductive carbon matrix. Structural and spectroscopic analyses suggest that Co 3 O 4 s","au":["Jingyi Sun","He Wang","Chengye Wang","Wenhao Liu","Qiang Liu","Kaiyi Chen"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zb":"报道了Co-NO/C催化剂，其Co3O4和Co4N位点协同激活硝酸盐进行电催化还原氨。Co3O4位点吸附活化NO3-，Co4N位点提供活性氢。在H型电池中，该催化剂在-0.6 V vs. RHE下达到99.7%的法拉第效率和62.4 mg h−1 mg cat.−1的氨产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78809","t":"Copper Single Atoms on a Photothermal Heterostructure for Dual‐Field‐Driven Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78809","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work presents a dual-field-driven strategy integrating a localized thermal field and a built-in electric field within a photothermal heterostructure. Cu single atoms anchored on CeO 2 /Co 3 O 4 promote NO 3 − adsorption and effectively inhibit the hydrogen evolution reaction. The dual-field facilitates the interfacial charge transfer and enhances the reaction rate, achieving efficient nitrate electroreduction to ammonia. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic reactions involving multiple electrons and protons, such as nitrate reduction to ammonia, are constrained by sluggish interfacial charge-transfer and inefficient mass transport. Here, we propose a dual-field-driven strategy that integrates the local thermal field and the built-in electric field within a photothermal heterostructure, enabling concerted control over both atomic-scale active-site construction and the reaction microenvironment.","au":["Chuanzhen Feng","Shuangshuang Tang","Yating Wu","Qi Lan","Shicheng Xu","Jiangli Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"光热异质结构上铜单原子用于双场驱动硝酸盐制氨","zb":"该研究构建了集局部热场与内建电场于一体的光热异质结构，利用光生电子引导单原子铜锚定在CeO2/Co3O4上。在近红外照射下，该催化剂在-0.4 V vs. RHE下实现了110.5 µmol h−1 cm−2的氨产率，在-0.2 V vs. RHE下达到95.8%的法拉第效率，显著优于暗态性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.64898/2026.11.09.763769","t":"Gene-resolved metagenomics reveals partitioned nitrogen transformation potential in a landfill leachate sequencing batch reactor microbiome","u":"https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.11.09.763769","s":"预印本","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Landfill leachate can contain high concentrations of ammonia and organic nitrogen requiring treatment before discharge. Sequencing batch reactors (SBRs) promote biological nitrogen removal through alternating aerobic and anoxic conditions, but taxonomic profiling alone cannot resolve how nitrogen transformation and competing retention pathways are distributed across microbial communities. This study applied gene-resolved metagenomics to a sludge sample collected from a UK landfill leachate SBR. Nitrogen-metabolism genes were linked to contig-level taxonomic assignments and metagenome-assembled genome bins to examine nitrification, denitrification, dissimilatory nitrate reduction to ammonium (DNRA), and assimilatory nitrate reduction (ANR). Nitrogen-transformation potential was partitioned across dominant and minor taxa. Nitrospirota and Pseudomonadota were the most abundant classified ph","au":["Samuel Rattray","Lynsay Blake","Nicola Ingrey","Iain MacArthur"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zb":"该研究利用基因解析宏基因组学分析了垃圾渗滤液序批式反应器微生物组，发现Nitrospirota和Pseudomonadota是优势菌门，而Nitrospira和Pseudomonas等属在氮转化基因分布上具有显著差异，揭示了低丰度贡献者及氮保留潜力。","ob":"其他催化反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.3390/nano16221454","t":"Facet- and Potential-Dependent Electroreduction of Nitrate Ions on Model Copper Electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano16221454","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) offers a sustainable pathway for both wastewater treatment and ammonia synthesis, yet its performance is highly sensitive to the catalyst surface structure and electrolyte composition. Here, we systematically investigate the facet-dependent activity on Cu(111), Cu(110), and Cu(100) single-crystal electrodes toward NO3RR in alkaline and bicarbonate media. Our results reveal that the activity trend for both nitrite and ammonia formation follows the order Cu(111) < Cu(110) < Cu(100) in both electrolytes. Cu(100) exhibits the highest activity for ammonia production, while Cu(111) suffers from pronounced kinetic hindrance due to the accumulation of *NOx intermediates that block the surface, leading to significant time-dependent deactivation. While (bi)carbonate anions inhibit NO3RR by competitive adsorption, they also inhibit hydrogen evo","au":["Maria R. Ehrenburg","Elena B. Molodkina","Zi-Han Chen","Jianfeng Li","Alexander V. Rudnev"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"模型铜电极上硝酸根离子面依赖性与电位依赖的电还原","zb":"该研究系统研究了Cu(111)、Cu(110)和Cu(100)单晶电极在碱性和碳酸氢盐介质中硝酸根还原反应（NO3RR）的面依赖性。结果表明氨生成活性顺序为Cu(100) > Cu(110) > Cu(111)，且Cu(111)因中间体*NOx积累导致动力学受阻。在KHCO3中，碳酸氢根离子通过竞争吸附抑制析氢反应，实现了近100%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c03827","t":"Converting Waste Tires into Blue Ammonia: Safe and Sustainable Process Design, Multiobjective Optimization and Comprehensive Assessment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c03827","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia synthesis based on steam methane reforming (SMR) is characterized by intensive energy consumption and high carbon emissions. To address these limitations, novel processes integrating gasification and carbon capture technologies were proposed for converting waste tires into blue ammonia. Detailed safety, techno-economic, and life cycle assessments were conducted to evaluate comprehensive performance. Machine learning-driven multiobjective operation optimization was carried out for reducing levelized cost of ammonia (LCOA) while enhancing safety and sustainability scores based on safe-and-sustainable-by-design framework. Our results highlight the critical role of artificial neural networks in achieving efficient optimization. Additionally, the quantitative impacts of integrating various renewable energy sources were investigated. The results showed the conventional gasific","au":["Jingyuan Liu","Jianzhao Zhou","Qiming Qian","Sheng Yang","Chang He","Jingzheng Ren"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"将废轮胎转化为蓝色氨：安全可持续工艺设计、多目标优化与综合评估","zb":"提出将废轮胎气化与碳捕集技术结合的工艺设计用于合成蓝色氨。基于安全可持续设计框架，利用机器学习进行多目标操作优化。在当前电力情景下，传统气化结合MDEA碳捕集的LCOA为358.1 $/吨，环境可持续性评分达0.443，优于传统SMR工艺。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142094","t":"Synergistic effect of AlH3 catalysis and ZIF-8 nanoconfinement on ammonia borane dehydrogenation for onboard applications: by DFT calculations and experiments","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142094","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Mengbo Wu","Qingrong Zheng"],"o":"日常","zt":"AlH3催化和ZIF-8纳米受限对车载应用氨硼烷脱氢的协同效应：DFT计算与实验","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.egyr.2026.109890","t":"Systematic and critical review of optimization models for green hydrogen and ammonia supply chains","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.egyr.2026.109890","s":"Energy Reports","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Green hydrogen and green ammonia supply chains integrate variable renewable electricity with electrolysis, nitrogen separation, ammonia synthesis, storage, transportation, reconversion, and end-use decisions. However, the optimization literature remains heterogeneous in mathematical assumptions, system boundaries, temporal representation, uncertainty treatment, adaptive decision mechanisms, and computational tractability, limiting consistent model selection and cross-study comparison. This paper presents a systematic and critical review of optimization models for integrated green hydrogen and ammonia supply chains, based on 118 studies. The review applies a controlled record-level taxonomy covering the base modeling or assessment approach, objective structure, dominant supply-chain scope, spatial scale, temporal structure, time-step resolution, uncertainty treatment, and adaptive or onli","au":["Asmaa Khourdifi","Yassine Eddouh","Rabie El Otmani","Khalid Kandoussi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"绿色氢气和氨气供应链优化模型的系统与关键综述","zb":"该文基于118项研究，系统综述了集成绿色氢气和氨气供应链的优化模型。分析表明现有文献在数学假设、系统边界和不确定性处理上存在异质性，线性规划和网络规划方法占主导，而全链路集成和鲁棒性处理仍不成熟。文章提出了决策导向的模型选择框架和未来研究方向。"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-11191906/v1","t":"Carbon Di-carbene Allotrope as a Zero- Dimensional Carbon Platform for Small-Molecule Activation and Nitrogen-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-11191906/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract Carbon allotropes span molecular to extended architectures, with dimensional-ity playing a central role in determining their electronic structure and chemical reactivity. Inspired by the unique electronic characteristics of carbenes and the functional diversity of carbon allotropes, we computationally design a previously unexplored zero-dimensional carbon dicarbene allotrope (CDCA) at the ωB97XD/Def2-TZVP level. CDCA is composed exclusively of carbon atoms and incorporates two electronically communicating carbene centres within a cyclic molecular framework. Density-of-states analysis and ab initio molecular dynamics simulations are employed to characterize its electronic structure, reactive sites, and structural stability. The singlet state is substantially more stable than the triplet state, while the carbon framework remains structurally stable during the investigated finite-t","au":["Rahul das","Purnendu Mahata","Arijit Bag"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrogen-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"碳二卡宾同素异形体作为零维碳平台用于小分子活化与氮气转化为氨","zb":"基于卡宾独特的电子特性和碳同素异形体的功能多样性，研究者在 ωB97XD/Def2-TZVP 水平上计算设计了一种此前未探索的零维碳二卡宾同素异形体（CDCA）。密度态分析和从头算分子动力学模拟表明 CDCA 对 SO2、NO、CO2 等小分子具有显著反应性，且能通过双中心构型促进 N2 的取向依赖性活化与 N–N 键断裂，最终提供了一条计算出的 NH3 形成路径。","ob":"其他催化反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c03171","t":"Acid-Etched Lead Telluride with Defect-Regulated Surfaces Enables Efficient Mechanical-Energy-Driven Nitrogen Fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c03171","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract Ambient ammonia synthesis is important for carbon neutrality. Tribo-electro-catalysis, which converts mechanical friction into chemical driving force through contact electrification and charge transfer, offers a route for nitrogen (N2) fixation. However, inefficient utilization of friction-induced charges and insufficient N2 activation remain major challenges. Herein, acid-etching defect engineering regulates the surface and electronic structures of lead telluride (PbTe) for N2 fixation. The catalyst etched for 90 min exhibits the enhanced activity under dark ambient conditions, delivering ammonium (NH4+) production rates of 258.98 and 329.60 μmol L–1·g–1·h–1 without and with 10 vol % methanol, respectively. Analyses reveal that etching reconstructs the surface, generates defect sites, facilitates N2 adsorption and activation, and promotes friction-induced charge utilization. Ex","au":["Hongda Zhu","Zheng Wu","Luohong Zhang","Siqi Hong","Huijuan Li","Huilin You"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"酸蚀缺陷调控表面的铅碲用于高效机械能驱动氮固定","zb":"通过酸蚀缺陷工程调控铅碲的表面和电子结构，实现了暗环境下的氮固定。经90分钟酸蚀的催化剂在无甲醇和含10%甲醇条件下，NH4+产率分别为258.98和329.60 μmol L–1·g–1·h–1。研究表明酸蚀重构表面并生成缺陷位点，促进N2吸附活化及摩擦诱导电荷利用。"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07010h","t":"Nucleation, orientation, and optical properties of ultrathin iron oxide grown by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07010h","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Oriented, crystalline hematite is grown on sapphire by atomic layer deposition (ALD) at temperatures as low as 200 °C. Growth on ALD Ga 2 O 3 on sapphire also produces hematite with complex refractive indices characteristic of crystalline hematite.","au":["Alex B. F. Martinson","Ashley R. Bielinski","Asare Dua"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积生长的超薄氧化铁的成核、取向和光学性质","zb":"在 200 °C 的低温下，原子层沉积（ALD）在蓝宝石上生长了取向的结晶赤铁矿，在 ALD Ga2O3 蓝宝石衬底上生长的赤铁矿也表现出结晶赤铁矿的特征复折射率。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c09970","t":"Defect-Driven Bimetallic Modulation: Accelerating Electrocatalytic Ammonia Oxidation Kinetics via a Nitrogen-Deficient FeCuN-Derived Architecture","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c09970","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic ammonia oxidation (AOR) offers an energy-efficient route to carbon-free hydrogen production but is constrained by sluggish multielectron-transfer kinetics and adsorbate evolution mechanism (AEM) scaling relationships. Here, electrodeposition yielded a nickel-foam-supported bimetallic FeCuN catalyst (FeCuN-BH), followed by high-temperature hydrogenation to introduce abundant lattice nitrogen vacancies (FeCuN-AH). The rationally engineered FeCuN-AH architecture demonstrates superior AOR performance, requiring an exceptionally low applied potential of 0.61 V vs the saturated calomel electrode (SCE) to reach 50 mA cm–2, together with an apparent Tafel slope of 934.7 mV dec–1, substantially lower than the 2408 mV dec–1 measured for FeCuN-BH, and stable operation over 50 h. Comprehensive density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidate a lattice nitrogen vacancy","au":["Rongtian Jiang","Zhipin Xu","Xin Yao","Dashuai Wang","Hui Zeng","Junhui Liang"],"o":"日常","why":["Electrocatalytic Ammonia"],"zt":"缺陷驱动双金属调制：通过氮缺陷 FeCuN 衍生架构加速电催化氨氧化动力学","zb":"研究对象为电催化氨氧化 (AOR) 体系，采用电沉积法制备镍泡沫支持的双金属 FeCuN 催化剂 (FeCuN-BH)，再经高温氢化引入丰富的晶格氮空位 (FeCuN-AH)。FeCuN-AH 架构表现出优异的 AOR 性能，在饱和甘汞电极 (SCE) 下 0.61 V 的极低施加电位下达到 50 mA cm–2，表观 Tafel 斜率为 934.7 mV dec–1，远低于 FeCuN-BH 的 2408 mV dec–1，且稳定运行 50 h。DFT 计算阐明晶格氮空位介导的双位点协同机制 (LNVM-MSM)，氮空位作为氨吸附的优选活性中心，并将决速步骤 (*NH2 到 *NH) 的动能垒从铜位点的 2.04 eV 降低至 0.90 eV。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158547","t":"Descriptor-Guided Design of Ruthenium Catalysts for Ammonia Synthesis and Decomposition: From Promoters to Interfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158547","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-10T04:37:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ruthenium (Ru) catalysts exhibit high activity for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis and decomposition, governed by promoter chemistry, catalyst structure, and metal–support interactions (MSI). This review presents a descriptor-guided framework linking electronic, geometric, interfacial, and dynamic properties to reaction mechanisms and catalytic performance. Key steps, including nitrogen (N 2 ) dissociation, hydrogenation, nitrogen recombination, and hydrogen (H 2 ) inhibition, are examined alongside support selection, particle-size control, morphology, and interfacial engineering. Alkali, alkaline-earth, and rare-earth promoters are evaluated for their effects on Ru electronic structure, adsorption energetics, and active-site accessibility. Oxygen vacancies (OVs), strong metal–support interactions (SMSI), and electronic metal–support interactions (EMSI) are discussed as regulators of interfaci","au":["Sameer Khan","Swati Singh","Tan Mingwu","Kyriaki Polychronopoulou"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于氨合成与分解的钌催化剂的描述符引导设计：从助剂到界面","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1007/s40820-026-02359-6","t":"Interfacial Electronic Regulation in N-Doped Carbon-Encapsulated NiCo Alloy Enables High-Current Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40820-026-02359-6","s":"Nano-Micro Letters","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO 3 − RR) offers a route to couple wastewater remediation with green ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis, but remains kinetically and mechanistically challenging under high-current-density operation. Herein, an N-doped carbon-encapsulated NiCo alloy catalyst (NiCo@NC) is derived from a NiCo-ZB precursor supported on conductive carbon black. The cathodic NO 3 − RR over NiCo@NC achieves an NH 3 yield rate of 187 mol h −1 g cat −1 with 95% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at −0.6 V RHE in an H-type cell and sustains ~92% FE at 2.0 A cm −2 under a cell voltage of 3.3 V in a membrane–electrode assembly. Pairing this cathodic NO 3 − RR with anodic methanol oxidation to formate enables simultaneous NH 3 and formate production at 2.1 A cm −2 under a cell voltage of 2.8 V, while maintaining NH 3 and formate FEs above 90% and 96%, respectively. In situ Fourier transform ","au":["Qizhi Hu","Siyu Zhu","Biao Meng","Mingdong Sun","Ming Wang","Xiaoling Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"界面电子调控：氮掺杂碳包覆 NiCo 合金实现高电流硝酸盐至氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原 (NO 3 − RR) 体系，制备氮掺杂碳包覆 NiCo 合金催化剂 (NiCo@NC)。在 H 型电池中，NiCo@NC 在 –0.6 V RHE 下实现 187 mol h −1 g cat −1 的氨产率，95% 法拉第效率 (FE)，在 3.3 V 电池电压下，膜电极组件中 2.0 A cm −2 下维持 ~92% FE。阴极 NO 3 − RR 与阳极甲醇氧化联产氨和甲酸盐，在 2.8 V 电池电压下 2.1 A cm −2 下氨和甲酸盐 FE 分别高于 90% 和 96%。原位傅里叶变换红外光谱和原位 X 射线吸收精细结构光谱揭示 *NO 优先稳定和钴价态/配位的可逆性，理论计算披露 NiCo 合金核与氮掺杂碳壳之间的界面电荷极化，构建电子贫乏的石墨碳和电子丰富的吡啶氮区域组成的双位点，加速水裂解/质子供应，降低 *NO → *NOH 决速步骤的势垒","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s11814-026-00878-x","t":"Mechanochemical Synthesis of Ru/γ-Al2O3 Catalysts: Influence of Ru Precursor and Milling Parameters on Structure–Activity Correlation for NH3 Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11814-026-00878-x","s":"Korean Journal of Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["ChangJin Han","Jae Min Park","Do Heui Kim"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 Decomposition"],"zt":"机械化学合成Ru/γ-Al2O3催化剂：Ru前驱体和研磨参数对NH3分解结构-活性相关性的影响","ob":"机械化学制氨；涉及Ru/钌体系｜机械力驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.2045143","t":"A Single‐COF Photocatalytic System for One‐Pot Oxygen Reduction Coupled Ammoximation of Cyclic Ketones","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2045143","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-08","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":13,"ab":"Porphyrin–polyimide COFs enable one-pot oxygen reduction coupled ammoximation of cyclic ketones. Photoinduced electron transfer activates O 2 at imide carbonyl sites, generating *OOH that directly oxidizes NH 4 + to NH 2 OH, which then condenses with ketones. IMCOF-1 delivers cyclohexanone oxime at 18.55 mmol g − 1 h − 1 , avoiding H 2 O 2 accumulation and enabling a single-COF cascade. ABSTRACT Photocatalytic oxygen reduction over covalent organic frameworks (COFs) has been extensively studied for H 2 O 2 production, but the in situ utilization of oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) intermediates in chemical synthesis remains underexplored. Herein, two porphyrin-based polyimide COFs, IMCOF-1 and IMCOF-2, are reported as photocatalysts for the one-pot ORR-coupled ammoximation of cyclic ketones using O 2 and NH 4 OAc. Under light irradiation, IMCOF-1 achieves a cyclohexanone oxime formation r","au":["Jiali Li","Ruipeng Li","Chuanbao Jiao","Jiashuai Teng","Xueshan Xing","Hui Li"],"o":"日常","zt":"单-COF光催化系统用于一锅氧还原耦合环酮肟化","zb":"报道了两种基于卟啉的聚酰亚胺 COFs（IMCOF-1 和 IMCOF-2）作为光催化剂，用于环酮的一锅氧还原耦合肟化反应。光诱导电子转移在酰亚胺羰基位点活化 O2，生成的 *OOH 直接氧化 NH4+ 为 NH2OH，进而与酮缩合生成肟。IMCOF-1 在光照射下实现了 18.55 mmol g−1 h−1 的环己酮肟生成速率，避免了 H2O2 积累。","ob":"光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apenergy.2026.129211","t":"Techno-economic optimization of a low-carbon ammonia synthesis system integrated with coal-to‑hydrogen and power-to‑hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apenergy.2026.129211","s":"Applied Energy","d":"2026-11-07","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ruizhe Wang","Hanfei Zhang","Mingjia Sun","Luyao Liu","Liqiang Duan","Jihong Fan"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"与煤制氢和电制氢生产集成的低碳氨合成系统的技术经济优化","bt":1},{"id":"10.1007/s13391-026-00672-1","t":"Spinel Cobalt Oxide-based Electrocatalysts for Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion: Catalyst Design and Dynamic Surface Reconstruction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s13391-026-00672-1","s":"Electronic Materials Letters","d":"2026-11-07","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Seonghyeon Park","Jinuk Choi","Myeong Gon Kim","Hyojung Lim","Chanmin Jo","Uk Sim"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"用于硝酸盐到氨转化的尖晶石氧化物基电催化剂：催化剂设计与动态表面重构","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c04345","t":"Incorporating Co-Encapsulated N-Doped Carbon Nanotube with Zn Phthalocyanine: Accelerated Water Dissociation Kinetics for Hydroxylamine Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c04345","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-11-07","f":"2026-11-08T17:04:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrite (NO2–) reduction to hydroxylamine (NH2OH) under ambient conditions is regarded as a sustainable way to simultaneously enable pollutant abatement and value-added chemical synthesis; however, the intrinsically sluggish kinetics and competing over-reduction to ammonia necessitate the rational exploration of robust electrocatalytic systems. Herein, we report the anchoring of zinc phthalocyanine (ZnPc) molecules onto bamboo-like nitrogen-doped carbon nanotubes encapsulating metallic cobalt nanoparticles (Co-NCNT) for selectively converting NO2– to NH2OH. The resulting ZnPc/Co-NCNT electrocatalyst achieves a considerable NH2OH yield of 0.25 mmol h–1 mgcat–1 and a high Faradaic efficiency of 64.32% at −0.3 V vs RHE, significantly outperforming its monocomponent counterparts. Mechanistic investigations reveal that the Co-NCNT facilitates charge transfer and lowe","au":["Junyu Chen","Jingyao Zhao","Lunhong Ai","Aike Liu","Jing Jiang"],"o":"日常","zt":"将 Co-包覆的氮掺杂碳纳米管与 Zn 菁菁：加速羟胺电合成的水解动力学","zb":"研究对象为 ZnPc/Co-NCNT 电催化剂对亚硝酸根 (NO2–) 还原为羟胺 (NH2OH) 的催化性能。Co-NCNT 促进电荷转移并降低水水解势，实现 0.25 mmol h–1 mgcat–1 的 NH2OH 产率和 64.32% 的法拉第效率。构建的 Zn–NO2– 电池同时生成 NH2OH 并提供 7.22 mW cm–2 的峰值功率密度。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1117/12.3123214","t":"Effect of annealing on the properties of TiO2 film prepared by atom layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.3123214","s":"Twenty-First National Conference on Laser Technology and Optoelectronics","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Atomic layer deposition (ALD) TiO₂ thin films are widely used in optoelectronics, photocatalysis, and biomedical applications. However, their intrinsic absorption and defect-induced absorption limit their application in high-power laser optics. Annealing is an important post-treatment method to modulate the optical properties and reduce absorption. In this work, ALD-TiO₂ thin films were annealed in O₂ atmosphere at different temperatures. The effects of annealing temperature on the optical constants, surface morphology, crystal structure, and impurity states were systematically investigated using spectroscopic ellipsometry, atomic force microscopy (AFM), X-ray diffraction(XRD), Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy(FTIR), and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS). This work provides theoretical and experimental guidance for the preparation of low-absorption, high laser-damage-resistan","au":["Junhui Die","Bingcheng Xiong","Zhao Qiao","Liang Lv","Guorui Zhou","Fumin Qiu"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积制备的 TiO2 薄膜退火对其性能的影响","zb":"原子层沉积法制备的 TiO₂ 薄膜在光电子、光催化和生物医学应用中广泛使用，但其固有的吸收和缺陷诱导吸收限制了它们在高功率激光光学中的应用。退火是一种重要的后处理方法，用于调节光学性能并减少吸收。本研究中，在不同温度下将原子层沉积法制备的 TiO₂ 薄膜在 O₂ 气氛中退火，并使用光谱椭偏仪、原子力显微镜（AFM）、X 射线衍射（XRD）、傅里叶变换红外光谱（FTIR）和 X 射线光电子能谱（XPS）系统地研究了退火温度对光学常数、表面形貌、晶体结构和杂质状态的影响。这项工作为通过后退火处理制备低吸收、高激光损伤耐受性的原子层沉积 TiO₂ 光学薄膜提供了理论和实验指导。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.aqrep.2026.103903","t":"Role of phycospheric bacteria: Promoting the growth of Isochrysis zhanjiangensis and ammonia nitrogen removal in rearing water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aqrep.2026.103903","s":"Aquaculture Reports","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Isochrysis zhanjiangensis is crucial in the breeding of bivalves larval as an artificially cultivated feed microalga. To investigate their roles in algal–bacterial interactions, we isolated and identified two phycospheric bacterial strains, Halomonas piezotolerans and Alteromonas abrolhosensis, from I. zhanjiangensis and examined their effects on algal growth and ammonia nitrogen removal in aquaculture systems. The results indicated that both bacterial strains promoted the growth of I. zhanjiangensis; however, the effect of A. abrolhosensis was more pronounced. At a concentration of 108 cfu/mL, the A. abrolhosensis treatment group reached a cell density of 1.082 × 107 cells/mL on day 10, significantly higher than the control group by 16.26% (p 0.05). Furthermore, H. piezotolerans enhanced soluble protein synthesis at low concentrations. In ammonia nitrogen removal experiments, H. piezoto","au":["Jin Huang","Jian Liang","Huiru Liu","Shuang Liang","Yongren Li","Limei Chen"],"o":"日常","zt":"球藻细菌的作用：促进 Isochrysis zhanjiangensis 的生长和养殖水中氨氮去除","zb":"从 Isochrysis zhanjiangensis 中分离并鉴定了两种球藻细菌菌株 Halomonas piezotolerans 和 Alteromonas abrolhosensis，研究了它们对藻类生长和养殖系统中文氨氮去除的影响。结果显示，两种细菌菌株都促进了 I. zhanjiangensis 的生长，其中 A. abrolhosensis 的效果更显著。在 108 cfu/mL 浓度下，A. abrolhosensis 处理组在第 10 天达到 1.082 × 107 cells/mL 的细胞密度，比对照组高 16.26%。此外，H. piezotolerans 在低浓度下增强了可溶性蛋白合成。在氨氮去除实验中，H. piezotolerans 表现出优异和稳定的活性，而 A. abrolhosensis 也促进了氮还原。qPCR 验证显示，H. piezotolerans"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c16802","t":"Reorganization of Interfacial Water by Cu–Ru Interfaces for Efficient Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c16802","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction offers a sustainable route for ammonia (NH3) synthesis, yet its efficiency is limited by sluggish N–O bond cleavage, incomplete NOx hydrogenation, and competing hydrogen evolution reaction. However, how catalyst structural engineering regulates the interfacial microenvironment remains unclear, despite its critical importance for constructing efficient catalysts. Here, we report a Cu3Ru7 catalyst with abundant Cu–Ru interfaces, where interface-induced water reorganization enables efficient NH3 production. The Cu3Ru7 catalyst exhibits an impressive NH3 formation rate of 19.7 mmol h–1 cm–2 at 5 A cm–2 in a membrane electrode assembly (MEA) electrolyzer and remains stable at 2 A cm–2 with an NH3 Faradaic efficiency of ∼86% for 500 h. A scale-up demonstration using a 100 cm2 MEA electrolyzer affords an NH3 formation rate up to 1.5 mol h–1 at 400 A. ","au":["Jing Xue","Tianfu Liu","Yi Wang","Yunfan Fu","Pengfei Wei","Yanpeng Song"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"Cu–Ru 界面重排界面水以实现高效硝酸盐到氨的电合成","zb":"报道了具有丰富 Cu–Ru 界面的 Cu3Ru7 催化剂，通过界面诱导的水重排实现高效 NH3 生成。在膜电极组件电解槽中，该催化剂在 5 A cm-2 下 NH3 生成率为 19.7 mmol h-1 cm-2，并在 2 A cm-2 下保持约 86% 的 NH3 法拉第效率长达 500 小时。原位 ATR-SEIRAS 和 AIMD 模拟表明，Cu–Ru 界面通过氢键网络稳定解离氧原子，促进 NOx 脱氧，同时 Cu 基体抑制了 Ru 的过量 *H 积累。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.1880547","t":"Weak Solvation Engineering of Reduction‐Stable Electrolytes for Durable Continuous Lithium‐Mediated Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1880547","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT Continuous lithium‐mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li‐NRR), which integrates anodic hydrogen oxidation with cathodic nitrogen fixation, opens a viable pathway for ambient ammonia synthesis. Nevertheless, its long‐term and efficient operation remains tremendously challenging due to severe solvent issues including polymerization, volatilization, and reductive decomposition. Here, we fundamentally uncover the intrinsic reductive decomposition mechanism of solvent molecules in ion–solvent complex‐dominated electrolytes, and develop a weak‐solvent modulation strategy to significantly enhance the reduction stability of solvent frameworks toward durable and efficient Li‐NRR operation. The optimized weakly solvating electrolyte attenuates solvent molecule distortion by Li + and promotes the formation of an anion‑enriched solvation sheath and a nanocrystalline LiF‑rich solid electr","au":["Kuiquan Yan","Yicheng Zhou","Yang Hong","Haixia Zhong","Xinbo Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于持久连续锂介导氨电合成的还原稳定电解质的弱溶剂工程","zb":"针对锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）中溶剂聚合、挥发和还原分解的问题，开发了弱溶剂调制策略。该策略通过优化电解质，构建富阴离子溶剂鞘和纳米晶 LiF 富集固体电解质界面（SEI），有效抑制溶剂分解并促进 Li+ 传输。在优化条件下，实现了超过 300 小时的稳定连续 N2 电还原，NH3 法拉第效率达 69.5%，能量效率高达 23.2%。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c14894","t":"Site Sensitivity Resulting in Selective Hydroxylamine Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c14894","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract The electroreduction of nitrogen oxides offers a promising route for green synthesis of hydroxylamine (NH2OH). Although Pd exhibited high selectivity toward NH2OH production experimentally, we found the dominant hollow sites of pristine Pd prefer ammonia production via the NOH*-pathway. This discrepancy was resolved by unveiling the critical roles of in situ hydriding of Pd under operando conditions. Using Grand Canonical Monte Carlo simulations driven by machine learning potential, we demonstrated the potential-dependent structural evolution from pristine Pd to palladium hydride (PdHx) under −0.11 to −0.51 V vs RHE. For the in situ-generated PdHx surfaces with some amorphous or disordering features, the dominant hollow sites of Pd are blocked by adsorbed H* species, thereby repelling NO* to adsorb obliquely on PdHx top sites. The adsorption configuration of NO* steers the react","au":["Huijuan Jing","Jun Long","Chenyu Yang","Pu Guo","Jianping Xiao"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"导致选择性羟胺电合成的位点敏感性","zb":"研究发现原位生成的 PdHx 表面通过改变位点结构，使 Pd 的主导空位被 *H 物种占据，迫使 NO* 斜向吸附在 PdHx 顶位，从而引导反应路径从 NOH* 转向 HNO*，最终生成 NH2OH*。PdHx 顶位 d 带中心下移促进了 NH2OH* 脱附并防止过度还原为氨。基于多种催化剂的分析，确定了 HNO* 与 NOH* 的形成能及 NH2OH* 的吸附能是决定高羟胺选择性的关键特征。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta06914b","t":"CuCo Bimetallic Synergy: Layered Double Hydroxides for Efficient Ammonia Production from Electrocatalytic Nitrite Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta06914b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This study employed a straightforward hydrothermal method to successfully co-precipitate CuCoAl layered double hydroxide (LDH). By varying the Cu:Co molar ratio, LDH nanosheets approximately 200 nm in size were obtained,...","au":["Yang Wang","ＹＵＡＮ ＷＡＮＧ","Cuilian Sun","Tianxing Wu","Xiujing Xing","Wei Xiong"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"CuCo 双金属协同：层状双氢氧化物用于高效的电催化亚硝酸还原制氨","zb":"本研究采用简单的水热法成功共沉淀 CuCoAl 层状双氢氧化物（LDH）。通过改变 Cu:Co 摩尔比，获得了约 200 nm 的 LDH 纳米片。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41893-026-01981-x","t":"Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction to high-concentration ammonia via interfacial evaporation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41893-026-01981-x","s":"Nature Sustainability","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Synthesis of valuable ammonia through photocatalytic reduction of nitrogen is a promising sustainable route, but its efficiency remains limited. This work shows that coupling the reaction with solar-driven interfacial evaporation can substantially improve ammonia yield, concentration and purity.","au":["Bowen Lv","Xinfei Fan","Yuanlu Xu","Yanbin Xin","Chengwen Song","Yanming Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"通过界面蒸发进行光催化氮还原以获得高浓度氨","zb":"通过光催化还原氮合成有价值的氨是一种可持续的途径，但其效率仍然有限。本研究表明，将反应与太阳能驱动的界面蒸发相结合可以显著提高氨的产率、浓度和纯度。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c04063","t":"Metal−Organic Framework Nanosheet-Derived CuO for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c04063","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO3RR) offers a “two birds with one stone” strategy by simultaneously removing pollutants and producing value-added ammonia (NH3). However, its multiple electron- and proton-transfer steps require catalysts with both high activity and selectivity. Copper (Cu) is widely regarded as one of the most promising NO3RR electrocatalysts due to its low cost and relatively high activity, yet its ammonia yield rate is usually constrained by sluggish nitrite conversion kinetics. Herein, a series of Cu-based catalysts with distinct oxidation states and crystallinity were derived from Cu-based metal−organic framework nanosheets (Cu-MOF NSs) by adjusting the pyrolysis conditions, and their NO3RR performance in alkaline media was evaluated. The low-crystallinity copper oxide catalyst (CuO-1) achieved the highest NH3 yield rate of 11.5 mg cm−2 h−1 at −0.8 V vs","au":["Yu Fan","Zhenyang Meng","Jiarui Zhang","Xianghui Jiang","Wei Cui","Yecan Pi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"金属-有机框架纳米片衍生的 CuO 用于高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原 (NO3RR) 通过同时去除污染物和生产有价值的氨 (NH3) 提供了一种“一石二鸟”的策略。然而，其多电子和质子转移步骤需要具有高活性和选择性的催化剂。铜 (Cu) 由于其低成本和相对较高的活性，被广泛认为是 NO3RR 电催化剂中最有希望的之一，但其氨产率通常受到亚硝酸转化动力学缓慢的限制。在此，通过调整热解条件，从基于铜的金属-有机框架纳米片 (Cu-MOF NSs) 衍生了一系列具有不同氧化态和结晶度的铜基催化剂，并评估了它们在碱性介质中的 NO3RR 性能。低结晶度氧化铜催化剂 (CuO-1) 在 -0.8 V vs 可逆氢电极 (RHE) 下实现了 11.5 mg cm−2 h−1 的最高 NH3 产率，显著优于金属铜催化剂 (Cu@NC)、高结晶度氧化铜催化剂 (CuO-2) 和大多数先前报道的催化剂。机理研究表明，CuO-1 在反应过程中部分还原以产生 C","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c18993","t":"Interfacial Synergy Triggered Intrinsic Tandem Catalysis for High-Efficiency Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c18993","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) has emerged as a sustainable circular-economy approach that enables simultaneous remediation of nitrate-contaminated wastewater and green ammonia synthesis. However, practical implementation of NO3RR is severely hindered by complicated multi-proton-electron transfer processes, undesirable nitrite accumulation, and competing hydrogen evolution reactions. While bimetallic heterostructured tandem catalysts hold great potential to address these issues, conventional spatially separated dual-site configurations still suffer from sluggish intermediate relay, mismatched reaction kinetics, and uncontrollable nitrite desorption. Herein, we fabricate a nanoparticle-assembled needle-like CuO/Co3O4 heterostructure and propose an interfacial synergy-triggered intrinsic tandem catalysis strategy. The optimized CuO/Co3O4 (1:1) delivers an NH3 y","au":["Haoyu Qiu","Xinfa Zhang","Xiaoyang Yang","Wei Jiang","Zhenqiang Yuan","Pan Chu"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"界面协同触发的内在串联催化用于高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）作为一种可持续的循环经济方法，能够同时修复硝酸盐污染的废水和绿色氨合成。然而，NO3RR 的实际应用受到复杂的质子-电子转移过程、不希望的亚硝酸盐积累和竞争性析氢反应的严重阻碍。双金属异质结构串联催化剂具有巨大的潜力来解决这些问题，但传统的空间分离双位点配置仍然存在中间体传递缓慢、反应动力学不匹配和亚硝酸盐脱附不可控的问题。本研究中，我们制备了纳米颗粒组装的针状 CuO/Co3O4 异质结构，并提出了一种界面协同触发的内在串联催化策略。优化的 CuO/Co3O4 (1:1) 在 –0.9 V vs RHE 下提供 NH3 收率为 1.06 ± 0.07 mmol h–1 mg–1 (0.53 ± 0.035 mmol h–1 cm–2)，在 –0.8 V vs RHE 下最大法拉第效率为 95.57 ± 1.15%，优于单金属对应物和物理混合物。异质界面调","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3389/fpls.2026.2010688","t":"Physiology-informed UAV multispectral estimation of tobacco leaf nitrogen nutrition index for variable nitrogen management","u":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fpls.2026.2010688","s":"Frontiers in Plant Science","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Introduction Spatial variability in crop nitrogen (N) status limits the effectiveness of uniform fertilization in tobacco, yet remotely sensed spectral signals cannot be directly translated into crop N demand. This study developed a physiology-informed unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) multispectral framework linking leaf dry matter (LDM), leaf N concentration (LNC), the leaf nitrogen nutrition index (NNIleaf), and variable N management. Methods Field experiments involving seven N application rates (0–150 kg N ha −1 ) were conducted in Yunnan, China, during 2023–2024. A critical leaf-N relationship was established using ln(LDM) and LNC. Multispectral vegetation indices were screened using Pearson correlation analysis and recursive feature elimination. Partial least squares regression (PLSR), random forest (RF), and extreme gradient boosting (XGBoost) were compared for estimating ln(LDM) and ","au":["Jizhong Yang","Chuixin Lou","Shaorong Yang","Wenbiao Wu","Lin Peng","Xiangqi Xu"],"o":"日常","zb":"该研究建立了基于无人机多光谱框架的烟草叶片干物质、氮浓度及氮营养指数估算模型，通过2023–2024年田间实验筛选关键关系，在2024年独立验证中R²达到0.826，并推荐了97.12 kg N ha−1的平均施氮量以优化产量和变异性。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1038/s41893-026-01982-w","t":"Making ammonia at the water’s edge","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41893-026-01982-w","s":"Nature Sustainability","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrogen fixation can make ammonia from nitrogen and water under mild conditions, but slow nitrogen delivery and product build-up limit output. Now, a floating solar interface couples nitrogen reduction with evaporation, greatly speeding up ammonia formation and concentrating a high-purity product in the condensate.","au":["Shuai Guo","Hui Ying Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"在水边制氨","zb":"光催化氮固定可以在温和条件下将氮和水转化为氨，但氮传递缓慢和产物积累限制了产量。现在，一个浮动的太阳能界面将氮还原与蒸发耦合，大大加快了氨的形成，并在冷凝水中集中了高纯度的产物。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jchemed.6c01163","t":"Catalytic Hydrolysis of Ammonia Borane: An Integrated Undergraduate Experiment on Hydrogen Production and Utilization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jchemed.6c01163","s":"Journal of Chemical Education","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-09T02:38:23Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia borane (NH3BH3, AB) is a chemical hydrogen storage material with high hydrogen content, low molecular weight, and good stability. Herein, an undergraduate laboratory experiment was designed for students in materials science, chemical engineering, energy science, and related disciplines to demonstrate H2 production from AB hydrolysis and its application. A Pd/C nanocomposite was employed as a catalyst in the experiment that integrates kinetic analysis with practical utilization. Students first recorded H2-production curves and determined key parameters of turnover frequency and activation energy and then used the generated H2 to power a small fuel-cell car. The entire experiment was completed within approximately 4 h. Through this experiment, students may develop essential experimental skills and gain a systematic understanding of H2 generation from AB hydrolysis and its ","au":["Xiaochen Qi","Yi Xiong","Jinzhi Li","Jun Zhang","Huanyu Yu","Pengfei Li"],"o":"日常","zt":"氨硼烷催化水解：氢气生产与利用的集成本科实验","zb":"利用 Pd/C 纳米复合材料作为催化剂，设计了一个集成动力学分析与实际应用的本科实验。学生在约 4 小时内记录了产氢曲线并测定了关键参数，随后利用生成的氢气驱动小型燃料电池车。","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71803","t":"Engineering Energy‐Storage Interfaces With Atomic and Molecular Layer Deposition: From Surface Chemistry to Process Design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71803","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"ABSTRACT The performance and lifetime of energy‐storage devices are determined at the interfaces between electrodes, electrolytes, and separators, where ion and charge transfer, parasitic reactions, and mechanical degradation originate within nanometers of the surface. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) and molecular layer deposition (MLD) enable precise engineering of these interfaces through self‐limiting surface reactions that produce conformal coatings with controlled thickness and composition, even on porous electrodes. Although ALD surface chemistry is well established on ideal oxide surfaces, energy‐storage materials present chemically and structurally complex surfaces, on which reaction mechanisms, growth per cycle, and coating function can differ. This Review develops a chemistry–process–structure–function framework that connects surface chemistry, precursor reaction pathways, and nu","au":["Kyobin Park","Jeffrey W. Elam"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"利用原子层沉积与分子层沉积工程化储能界面：从表面化学到工艺设计","zb":"综述利用原子层沉积（ALD）和分子层沉积（MLD）通过自限制表面反应精确工程化电极、电解质和隔膜界面，构建化学-工艺-结构-功能框架，分析在氧化物、硫化物、金属、聚合物和碳基底上的生长机理及在锂基及非锂电池中的应用。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71764","t":"Ionomer-free Iridium Anodes with Low Loading for Zero-gap Electrolyzers via Direct Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71764","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:00:02Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) is among the most promising techniques to provide hydrogen as both energy carrier and feedstock for the chemical industry, due to its compatibility with intermittent renewable electricity sources. However, a major bottleneck in scaling up PEMWE is the limited supply of the anode catalyst Ir. This work shows a novel approach to tailoring ionomer-free catalyst layers based on custom-made microporous substrates and two different atomic layer deposition (ALD) processes, both using Ir(EtCp)(CHD) precursor. Thermal ALD using O3 as counter-reactant yields mostly metallic Ir/IrOx and an electrode Ir loading of 0.21 mg/cm2. The PEMWE cell-level performance is comparable to a commercial catalyst-coated membrane anode despite 7x lower loading, and is maintained over an accelerated durability test equivalent to 600 h of intermittent operation. More","au":["Peter M. Piechulla","Iris Blommestein","Anne van Gerven","Henri Pelzer","Ezgi Demiröz","Jonas Englhard"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"基于直接原子层沉积的无离子膜铱阳极","zb":"针对质子交换膜水电解槽中铱催化剂供应受限的问题，利用定制微孔基底和两种原子层沉积（ALD）工艺制备了无离子膜铱阳极。热ALD工艺制备的电极铱负载量为0.21 mg/cm2，其性能与商业催化剂涂层膜相当，且在等效600小时间歇运行测试中保持稳定。此外，利用等离子增强ALD将铱负载进一步降低至0.04 mg/cm2，并验证了该阳极与多种膜材料的兼容性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pp":"arXiv","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc05336j","t":"Photothermal Cu Island-Decorated NiFe Nanocone Arrays for Exceptional Tandem Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electroreduction and Zn-Nitrate Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc05336j","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In this paper, we construct Cu islands on NiFe nanocone arrays for the electroreduction of nitrate to ammonia. The integration of tandem catalysis heterointerfaces, geometric architecture, and photothermal effects synergistically...","au":["Xienan Mi","Yanqing Wang","Zijian Gao","Zitong Yan","Liping Ding","Qi Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"用于卓越串联硝酸盐-氨电还原及锌-硝酸盐电池的光热Cu岛装饰NiFe纳米锥阵列","zb":"在NiFe纳米锥阵列上构建Cu岛，集成串联催化异质界面、几何架构和光热效应协同促进硝酸盐还原。该体系在光热辅助下实现了高效的硝酸盐到氨的电还原及锌-硝酸盐电池性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.64509/jdi.14.173","t":"Dual-Metal Electron Pump Engineered Platinum-based HOR Catalysts for Ammonia-tolerant Hydrogen Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.64509/jdi.14.173","s":"Journal of Design Intelligence","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-08T17:04:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical hydrogen sensors are attractive for hydrogen detection owing to their high sensitivity, rapid response, and low energy consumption, offering great potential for safety monitoring in complex environments. However, the anodic HOR catalysts are highly susceptible to poisoning by interfering species such as ammonia, posing a critical challenge to the development of robust hydrogen sensors for ammonia-containing environments. Since binary transition metal elements are promising for further optimizing the HOR performance of platinum compared to single transition metals, metal salts with different combinations were dispersed on XC-72 by rotary evaporation here. After wet impregnation, FeCo-Pt, FeMn-Pt, CoMn-Pt, and Fe-Pt, were obtained by heat treatment under H2/Ar mixed gas. In this strategy, Fe and Co form an FeCo alloy during heat treatment. Compared to single-element doping,","au":["Changqing Jin","Rui Wang","Aojie Zhang","Yanshen Zhao","Zemin Huang","Haolin Tang"],"o":"日常","zt":"为氨耐受氢传感工程化双金属电子泵铂基析氢反应催化剂","zb":"研究通过旋转蒸发将不同组合的金属盐分散在 XC-72 上，经 H2/Ar 混合气体热处理制备了 FeCo-Pt、FeMn-Pt、CoMn-Pt 和 Fe-Pt 催化剂。该策略利用 Fe 和 Co 形成的 FeCo 合金作为“双金属电子泵”优化 Pt 电子结构，显著增强了电子转移能力，实现了 HOR 活性和抗氨干扰能力的同步提升。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15011724/v1","t":"Techno-Economic and Geospatial Assessment of Distributed Fertilizer Production via Wastewater Ammonia Solar Electrochemical Stripping","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15011724/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Decentralized alternatives to centralized fertilizer production are needed to reduce supply chain risks, minimize transportation costs, and lower environmental impacts. Solar-powered Electrochemical Stripping (ECS) is an emerging technology that can produce ammonium fertilizer in a distributed manner through wastewater nitrogen recovery. We quantify the fraction of fertilizer demand in the United States that can be met by a wastewater feedstock while minimizing transportation distances, finding that 55% (5.54 Mt N per year) of demand is co-located with sufficient supply from domestic, agricultural, or industrial wastewater. A techno-economic assessment of ECS at scales sufficient to meet localized fertilizer demand estimated breakeven prices of US$8.70/kg N for ammonium sulfate, US$9.69/kg N for ammonium nitrate, and US$31.18/kg N for monoammonium phosphate, and US$12.15/kg N for diammon","au":["Orisa Z. Coombs","Lorenzo Rosa","William A. Tarpeh"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过废水氨太阳能电化学剥离生产分布式肥料的技经与地空评估","zb":"评估了利用太阳能电化学剥离（ECS）技术从废水中回收氮生产分布式肥料的经济性和地空分布。研究量化了美国55%的肥料需求可由废水原料满足，并估算出硫酸铵、硝酸铵等肥料的盈亏平衡价格。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1103/3s5d-ys4b","t":"Cubic BN formation from ammonia borane (BH 3 NH 3 ) at extreme conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1103/3s5d-ys4b","s":"Physical Review B","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["D. Murayama","S. Ohmura","A. Amouretti","D. Singappuli","K. Taketoshi","N. Ozaki"],"o":"日常","zt":"极端条件下从氨硼烷 (BH 3 NH 3 ) 形成立方 BN","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.76525","t":"In Situ Reconstructed Core–Shell Fe‐MOF@Cu as a Tandem Electrocatalyst toward Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.76525","s":"Small","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction enables sustainable ammonia production and simultaneous nitrate pollutant abatement. Yet its multi‐step proton‐coupled electron transfer mechanism is hindered by slow reaction kinetics. Herein, we report a reconstructed tandem catalyst, Fe‐MOFs@Cu, generated through the in situ electrochemical transformation of a designed MIL‐101(Fe)@HKUST‐1 core–shell precursor. Under nitrate reduction conditions, the HKUST‐1 shell is selectively converted into Cu species, whereas the MIL‐101(Fe) core remains largely preserved, resulting in a reconstructed Cu/Fe heterointerface with spatially integrated active domains. Electrochemical and kinetic analyses reveal a clear functional differentiation between the two catalytic components. Cu‐rich domains preferentially promote nitrate activation to nitrite, while Fe‐based sites facilitate water activation and the s","au":["Qianqian Wang","Jiahao Ma","Yuting Zhang","Yunpei Zhu","Sifei Zhuo","Qiuyu Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"原位重构核壳 Fe-MOF@Cu 作为串联电催化剂将硝酸电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸电还原制备氨的串联电催化剂，通过原位电化学转化设计的 MIL-101(Fe)@HKUST-1 核壳前驱体制备 Fe-MOF@Cu 催化剂，HKUST-1 壳层选择性转化为 Cu 物种，MIL-101(Fe) 核层基本保持，形成 Cu/Fe 异质界面，具有空间集成活性区域。Cu 丰富的区域优先促进硝酸活化为亚硝酸，Fe 基位点促进水活化及亚硝酸的后续氢化为氨，界面耦合抑制亚硝酸积累和竞争性析氢。在 -0.5 V vs. RHE 下，R-MIL-101(Fe)@Cu 实现 0.61 mmol h −1 cm −2 的 NH 3 产率率和 94.9% 的法拉第效率，并具有优异的操作稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79457","t":"Precursor Size Governs Thermally Activated Solid State Conversion Into the Redox Active Framework Formation in Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79457","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Precursor-domain size is identified as a decisive kinetic parameter in the solid-state synthesis of Na 4 Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 P 2 O 7 . Oversized Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 domains restrict Na/P penetration and retain unreacted cores, whereas intermediate domains undergo heterogeneous conversion with residual phases. Submicrometre domains shorten the required transport distance, enabling near-complete conversion and formation of a uniform redox-active NFPP framework. ABSTRACT Na 4 Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 P 2 O 7 is an attractive Fe-based polyanionic cathode for low-cost sodium-ion batteries, but scalable synthesis remains constrained by the trade-off between precursor homogeneity and process compatibility. Soluble Fe salts enable intimate mixing, whereas Fe (II)-phosphate precursors avoid nitrate/oxalate burdens but react as insoluble domains. Here we identify precursor defined solid state reaction length as the k","au":["Yuanhang Wang","Hangxin Niu","Dongdong Li","Wei Han"],"o":"日常","zt":"前驱体尺寸调控热活化固态转化成氧化还原活性框架形成在 Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7 中","zb":"研究对象为 Na 4 Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 P 2 O 7 的固态合成，通过控制前驱体尺寸影响反应动力学， oversized Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 域限制 Na/P 渗透并保留未反应核心，亚微米域缩短传输距离实现近完全转化，形成均匀的氧化还原活性 NFPP 框架。实验证实前驱体尺寸调控 NFPP 合成，CV 前驱体在 0.1 C 下容量为 104.1 mAh g −1，20 C 下为 61.8 mAh g −1，并具有稳定的长期和全电池操作。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.4875918","t":"Magnetically Induced Reactive Carbon Capture With Ferromagnetic Multi‐Function Materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.4875918","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":19,"ab":"Magnetically induced reactive carbon capture (RCC) was demonstrated for the first time with ferromagnetic multifunction materials (MFMs) capable of adsorbing CO 2 and converting it to methane via rapid temperature swing powered by magnetic induction heating. These MFMs exhibited no activity under conventional heating, establishing magnetic reduction as a key enabling step. Application of induction heating to RCC can dramatically improve productivity by shortening cycle time and establishing a new power-to-X paradigm. ABSTRACT Thermochemical reactive carbon capture (tRCC) offers a direct pathway to convert dilute CO 2 into valuable fuels and chemicals. However, the scalability of tRCC is hindered by the thermal inertia of conventional reactors, which limits reactor throughput. Here, we report the first demonstration of magnetically induced reactive carbon capture (mRCC), utilizing high-fr","au":["Hyewon Lee","Cody J. Wrasman","Steven C. Hayden","Madeline Van Winkle","Klaertje K. Hesselink","Chae Jeong‐Potter"],"o":"日常","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"利用铁磁多功能材料进行磁诱导反应性碳捕获","zb":"首次利用铁磁多功能材料通过磁感应加热驱动的快速温度循环，实现CO2的吸附与转化为甲烷。研究发现磁感应加热能显著缩短反应时间，而常规加热会导致材料失活，磁诱导反应性碳捕获（mRCC）建立了新的电转X范式。","ob":"通用催化方法","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.71193","t":"Atomic Layer‐Deposited LSO Coating Stabilizes the Interface and Enhances the Electrochemical Performance of High‐Nickel NCM811 Cathode Material","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.71193","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"LiNi 0.8 Co 0.1 Mn 0.1 O 2 (NCM811) cathode material has attracted considerable attention because of its potential to achieve substantially higher energy densities, but the practical deployment of NCM811 remains hindered by severe interfacial and structural degradation during repeated cycling. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) was employed in this study to construct an amorphous Li─Si─O (LSO) coating layer with different thicknesses on the surface of NCM811 cathode materials, and their effects on the structural characteristics, interfacial properties, and electrochemical performance were systematically investigated. Among all the samples, 50 LSO@NCM811 exhibits the best electrochemical performance, retaining a discharge capacity of 115.96 mAh g −1 after 500 cycles at 1 C under a cutoff voltage of 4.3 V. By constructing a stable and ionically conductive interfacial protective layer, the LSO c","au":["Yao Yao","Zhongyuan Luo","Jianguo Duan","Jiyue Hou","Yongshun Liang","Chunman Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer-Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积的LSO涂层稳定界面并提高高镍NCM811正极材料的电化学性能","zb":"研究对象为NCM811正极材料，关键方法为原子层沉积（ALD）构建不同厚度的LSO涂层，主要结果为50 LSO@NCM811在1 C和4.3 V截止电压下循环500次后容量为115.96 mAh g −1，LSO涂层通过构建稳定的离子导电界面层，协同优化界面稳定性、结构稳定性和电化学动力学，显著提高NCM811电化学性能。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-78934-7","t":"Highly efficient and durable Ga-doped Ni/Al2O3 catalyst enhanced by interfacial Ga3+ for low-temperature ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-78934-7","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Ammonia could enable carbon-free hydrogen production, but efficient decomposition at low temperatures remains difficult. Trace gallium helps nickel catalysts remove surface hydrogen, markedly boosting low temperature activity.","au":["Xinru Zhao","Youning Zhang","Yafei Liu","Ouyang Liu","Shuzhuang Sun","Dandan Han"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"高效率和高耐久性的Ga掺杂Ni/Al2O3催化剂通过界面Ga3+增强低温氨分解","zb":"研究对象为Ni/Al2O3催化剂，关键方法为Ga掺杂，主要结果为微量Ga帮助Ni催化剂去除表面氢，显著提高低温活性。","ob":"氨分解制氢","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71797","t":"Relay Catalysis on Phase‐Separated Janus–CuCo Alloys for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction at Industrial Low Concentration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71797","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Phase-separated Janus CuCo alloys enable relay catalysis for electrochemical nitrate reduction at industrially low concentrations. Cu-rich and Co-rich domains play complementary roles, promoting nitrate activation, intermediate transfer, and hydrogenation at the Cu–Co interface. This interfacial synergy delivers enhanced activity, selectivity, and mechanistic insight for efficient nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. ABSTRACT Earth-abundant Cu and Co are attractive electrocatalysts for nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO 3 − RR); however, conventional solid-solution alloys with single-phase active sites lack effective intermediate spillover, impeding the hydrogenation of multiple reaction intermediates and limiting NH 3 selectivity under dilute nitrate conditions. Here we report phase-separated yet electronically coupled Janus–CuCo alloys synthesized via a time–charge regulated electrochemical re","au":["Mazhar Hayat","Enyang Sun","Min Wang","Qamir Iqbal","Wenwen Zhou","Yan Yan"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"用于工业低浓度下高效电化学硝酸盐还原的相分离Janus–CuCo合金上的接力催化","zb":"报道了相分离且电子耦合的Janus–CuCo合金，通过时间-电荷调控电化学还原策略合成。Cu富集和Co富集域协同促进硝酸盐活化、中间体转移和氢化，在MEA流动池中实现了95.5%的氨法拉第效率（FE NH3）和4.2 mg h−1 mg cat−1的产氨率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218725","t":"MXenes and their heterostructures for electrochemical nitrogen reduction: a pathway to green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218725","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T03:28:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Parnapalle Ravi","Vempuluru Navakoteswara Rao","Mashallah Rezakazemi","Jin-Seo Nho"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"MXenes 和它们的异质结构用于电化学氮还原：通往绿色氨合成的一条途径","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/systems14111407","t":"A Data-Driven Predictive Optimization Framework for the Dynamic Operation of Green Ammonia Energy Systems Under Uncertainty","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/systems14111407","s":"Systems","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Renewable power fluctuations and uncertain ammonia synthesis performance complicate operational coordination in green hydrogen–ammonia systems. This study develops a closed-loop prediction–scheduling framework using dual Gaussian processes to characterize renewable power and process performance. Calibrated lower and upper bounds enter material and energy constraints, while multi-objective particle swarm optimization balances operating cost and schedule variation. A joint-risk index selects plan retention, local repair, or global re-optimization, combined with plan refresh and conditional Pareto reuse in rolling horizon scheduling. The framework is evaluated with 24 h aggregated simulations using public meteorological data and published experimental data. Paired comparisons across seven fixed scenarios show that event-triggered and periodic scheduling both completed all 20 runs per scenar","au":["Han Xiao","Qi Tang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于绿色氨能源系统动态运行的基于数据的预测优化框架在不确定性下的绿色氨能源系统动态运行","zb":"研究对象为绿色氢-氨系统，关键方法为使用双高斯过程建模可再生能源功率和工艺性能，采用闭环预测-调度框架，多目标粒子群优化平衡运行成本和调度变化，联合风险指数选择计划保留、局部修复或全局重新优化，结合滚动时间窗调度中的计划刷新和条件帕累托重用。使用公开气象数据和已发表的实验数据进行24小时聚合模拟评估，事件触发和周期调度在七种固定场景中均完成所有运行并满足所有硬约束，事件触发在串行时间协议下减少控制器运行时间15.30–34.73%。234次补充压力测试请求中，177次完成当天，176次满足所有硬约束，1次终端审计失败，57次在搜索中停止。结果表明框架在模拟条件下协调概率预测、物理约束和调度响应，为绿色氢-氨系统运行优化提供可重复方法。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.proci.2026.106741","t":"Modelling emissions from ammonia combustors with the Incompletely Stirred Reactor Network method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2026.106741","s":"Proceedings of the Combustion Institute","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study assesses the Incompletely Stirred Reactor Network (ISRN) approach in terms of accuracy in capturing the scalar distributions in an ammonia-fuelled staged combustor employing various degrees of NH 3 partial cracking, characterised by the molar ammonia decomposition ratio (DR). Underlying solutions from Large Eddy Simulation with Conditional Moment Closure (LES-CMC) with D R = 0.25 for 10 bar and D R = 0.50 for 5 bar are used to explore the behaviour of the combustor at varying D R at the range 0.1 < DR < 0.9 at constant pressure without repeating the CFD simulation. The basic hypothesis is that the mixing field does not change significantly as the fuel changes, which enables the exploration of parameter spaces with a single reference LES-CMC simulation. The ISRN model accurately predicts temperature and NOx distributions across the full range of D R tested, showing good agreeme","au":["B. Harikrishnan","Epaminondas Mastorakos"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"使用不完全搅拌反应器网络方法模拟氨燃烧器排放","zb":"本研究评估了不完全搅拌反应器网络（ISRN）方法在捕获氨燃料分级燃烧器中不同 NH₃ 部分裂解程度（由摩尔氨分解比 DR 表征）的标量分布方面的准确性。使用大涡模拟与条件矩闭合（LES-CMC）的底层解，其中 DR = 0.25 对于 10 bar 和 DR = 0.50 对于 5 bar，在恒定压力下探索燃烧器在 0.1 < DR < 0.9 范围内不同 DR 的行为，而无需重复 CFD 模拟。基本假设是混合场在燃料变化时不会发生显著变化，这使人们能够使用单个参考 LES-CMC 模拟探索参数空间。ISRN 模型准确地预测了在整个 DR 测试范围内温度和 NOx 分布，与 LES-CMC 和实验结果均具有良好的吻合度。还探索了对化学机制的敏感性，发现所有测试方案都预测了相似的 NOx。结果表明，ISRN 可用作氨燃烧器排放的低阶模型，这有助于设计过程，并提供关于火焰结构随操作参数变化的见","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79405","t":"Dual‐Alloy Exsolution in Fe‐Based Perovskite Anodes for High‐Performance Direct Ammonia Solid Oxide Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79405","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Dual FeCo and FeNi alloy nanoparticles are exsolved from a multi-doped Fe-based perovskite anode for high-performance direct ammonia solid oxide fuel cells. The dual-alloy surface coordinates electronic structure modulation and nanoparticle morphology control, providing abundant reaction sites and complementary catalytic functions for NH 3 decomposition, NH x dehydrogenation, and N 2 removal. Consequently, the R-LSBMFCN anode delivers efficient NH 3 utilization, suppressed anode polarization, and stable direct ammonia solid oxide fuel cell operation. ABSTRACT Direct ammonia solid oxide fuel cells (DA-SOFCs) offer an integrated route for carbon-free power generation by coupling in situ ammonia decomposition with electrochemical hydrogen oxidation. However, anode catalysts must simultaneously achieve rapid NH 3 decomposition, efficient electrochemical charge transfer, and long-term resista","au":["Jungseub Ha","Sehun Choi","Sanghwa Jeong","Minguk Kwak","Daehwan Kim","Jongcheol Gang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"双合金析出在 Fe 基钙钛矿阳极中用于高性能直接氨固体氧化物燃料电池","zb":"研究对象为直接氨固体氧化物燃料电池 (DA-SOFCs) 的 Fe 基钙钛矿多掺杂 Co 和 Ni 阳极 La 0.6 Sr 0.2 Ba 0.2 Mn 0.2 Fe 0.6 Co 0.1 Ni 0.1 O 3 (P-LSBMFCN)，经 H 2 还原形成 Ruddlesden-Popper (RP) 层状氧化物装饰有高度分散的 FeCo 和 FeNi 合金纳米颗粒 (R-LSBMFCN)。Co 和 Ni 多掺杂调控合金化路径，减小纳米颗粒尺寸并增加密度。双合金架构提供丰富的活性位点，加速 NH 3 活化、NH x 中间转化和 N 重组/脱附，R-LSBMFCN 表现出最低的表观活化电阻。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/pr14213539","t":"Surrogate-Based Constrained Single-Objective Bayesian Optimization for Joule-Heated Methane Dry Reforming Reactors","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/pr14213539","s":"Processes","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Joule heating coupled with porous media offers rapid in situ heat generation and a more uniform temperature distribution for DRM reactions, whereas the strong coupling of structural and operating parameters renders conventional trial-and-error optimization inefficient and costly. To tackle this challenge, a multi-physics numerical model for a centrally resistively heated DRM reactor is constructed by coupling Joule heating, flow and heat transfer, multicomponent species transport, and apparent reaction kinetics. A fully connected feedforward neural network (FC-FNN) surrogate model is further established to enable rapid prediction of reactor performance. Seven critical input variables are selected, including reaction temperature, gas hourly space velocity (GHSV), etc., and 9216 simulation samples are generated via numerical simulations for surrogate model training and parametric analysis.","au":["Yanlun Ren","Daqing Tang","Li Zhang","Houfang Miao","Meiying Cui","Zhiwei Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"用于焦耳加热甲烷干重整反应器的基于代理的约束单目标贝叶斯优化","zb":"研究构建了多物理场数值模型和全连接前馈神经网络代理模型，利用贝叶斯优化算法在 H2/CO 比例和床层温度均匀性约束下优化反应器性能，优化后平均反应物转化率达 94.12%。","ob":"甲烷干重整｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6nr04094b","t":"MOF-Structured Metal@Carbon Core-Shell Hybrids for Efficient Joule Heating Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6nr04094b","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Active sites on which chemical reaction occurs are crucial in catalysis, energy storage, and environmental remediation. To achieve abundant active sites, materials with exceptional surface area have been pursued. Among...","au":["Manish Neupane","Jiayue Hu","Jiachun Wu","Wenhu Wang","Yaqing Guo","Chris Nelson"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"用于高效焦耳加热催化的 MOF 结构金属@碳核壳杂化物","zb":"为获得丰富的活性位点，研究利用 MOF 结构制备了金属@碳核壳杂化物，用于焦耳加热催化反应。","ob":"通用催化方法｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jenvman.2026.131297","t":"Joule heating for direct regeneration of spent lithium-ion batteries: Advances, advantages, and future perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvman.2026.131297","s":"Journal of Environmental Management","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"With cumulative spent lithium-ion battery (LIB) waste projected to exceed 11 million tonnes by 2030, rapid and low-carbon regeneration technologies are increasingly important for securing secondary resources. Joule heating provides heating and cooling rates of 103-105 K s-1 and millisecond-to-second thermal exposure, enabling impurity removal, lattice reconstruction and non-equilibrium defect regulation while limiting prolonged diffusion and side reactions. This review critically synthesizes Joule heating-enabled recycling, regeneration and upcycling of spent LIB anodes and cathodes, together with the underlying mechanisms, industrial barriers and environmental implications. Representative graphite-regeneration studies report >99% removal of Li and transition metal contaminants using only 0.1 M HCl, with regenerated or upcycled graphite delivering approximately 351-459 mAh·g-1. For catho","au":["Zhengyi Ouyang","Xuetian Li","Yong Cui","He Liu","Jia Li","Zhongcai Shao"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"用于废旧锂离子电池的直接再生：进展、优势与未来展望","zb":"研究对象为废旧锂离子电池，关键方法为闪蒸焦耳热，主要结果为使用0.1 M HCl去除Li和过渡金属污染物，再生石墨容量为351-459 mAh·g-1，LiCoO2直接再生后容量从103.9恢复到133 mAh·g-1，温室气体减排高达98%。","ob":"涉及碳材料｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c15718","t":"Electrolyte and Catalyst Cooperatively Control Proton Supply in Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electroreduction on CuRu at Positive Potentials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c15718","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Above 0 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode, the hydrogen evolution reaction is thermodynamically suppressed, making this potential region attractive for nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. However, in neutral and alkaline media typically used for the nitrate reduction reaction, protons for successive hydrogenation steps derive mainly from water dissociation, which becomes increasingly sluggish at more positive potentials. Proton availability thus governs the hydrogenation kinetics of nitrate and its intermediates. Using CuRu nanorods as a model catalyst, we resolve how the electrolyte and the catalyst jointly control the proton supply during NO3RR at positive potentials. Macroelectrode measurements reveal that the NO3– reduction kinetics depend on OH– concentration, and single-particle electrochemistry on a single CuRu nanorod, where ultrafast mass transport avoids local OH– ","au":["Jian Zhang","Thomas Quast","Esma Khatun","Yen-Ting Chen","Ridha Zerdoumi","Ann Cathrin Brix"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"电解质和催化剂在 CuRu 正电位硝酸盐到氨电还原中协同控制质子供应","zb":"利用 CuRu 纳米棒模型催化剂，研究电解质和催化剂如何协同控制正电位下的质子供应。宏观电极测量显示 NO3– 还原动力学依赖于 OH– 浓度，单颗粒电化学证实了这一点。原位扫描电化学显微镜表明 OH– 浓度通过增强的阳离子富集界面电场加速水分解，从而维持质子供应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c14152","t":"Deciphering Hot-Carrier Effects on Multiple Elementary Steps in Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c14152","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T02:59:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Plasmonic photocatalysis can enhance conventional chemical transformations, but macroscale kinetic metrics, such as overall reaction rates and apparent activation barriers, are insufficient to identify the specific elementary steps modulated by hot carriers, limiting precise control over catalytic reactivity and selectivity. Here, we apply a spectrokinetic strategy based on in situ diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (DRIFTS) to resolve elementary-step energetics in NH3 decomposition over CuRu alloy antenna–reactor catalysts. CuRu and Na-modified CuRu show different relative sensitivities to heating and illumination, providing a paired system for tracking how kinetic control is redistributed under thermal and plasmonic conditions. Temporal in situ DRIFTS and Arrhenius analysis identify site-dependent adsorbed N2 (*N2) intermediates and reveal a sequential","au":["Yaxi Gan","Huayue Yang","Dan Zeng","Bofang Wang","Shengqiang Nie","Lin Yuan"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"揭示氨分解中多基元步骤的热载流子效应","zb":"利用原位 DRIFTS 和 DFT 计算研究 CuRu 合金催化剂上氨分解的基元步骤。发现光照下 CuRu 的光特异性反应速率提升近三个数量级，界面 N2 迁移和台阶位点 N2 脱附的活化能分别降低 0.28 eV 和 0.75 eV，表明界面 N2 去除是光促进活性位点再生的关键步骤。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79467","t":"Ultrasonically Engineered Low‐Coordination Mn Sites in Fe‐MOF Promote Charge Separation for Sacrificial‐Agent‐Free Photocatalytic N2 Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79467","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The following paper sets out the design, synthesis, and schematic illustration of the photocatalytic nitrogen fixation mechanism of FeMnMOF photocatalysts with single-atom Mn─N sites. Among the prepared catalysts, U-FeMnMOF demonstrated the most effective photocatalytic nitrogen fixation capacity, with an ammonia yield of 1823.1 µmol·g −1 ·h −1 . ABSTRACT Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction involves complex proton-coupled multi-electron transfer processes, which bring about abundant reaction pathways and thus result in poorly controllable product selectivity. Benefiting from their unique electronic configuration and unsaturated coordination environment, single-atom photocatalysts can effectively regulate the reaction pathways of photoreductive N 2 activation and reduction, thereby improving the selectivity and NH 3 productivity of target ammonia products. Herein, an acetate-modified ultras","au":["Jingjing Wang","Xuejun Yang","Xue Zhao","Yafu Wang","Rui Ren","Yulan Gu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"超声工程化低配位Mn位点在Fe-MOF中促进电荷分离用于无牺牲剂的光催化N2还原","zb":"研究对象为FeMnMOF光催化剂，关键方法为超声工程化构建低配位Mn-N位点，主要结果为U-FeMnMOF氨产率为1823.1 µmol·g −1 ·h −1，Mn-N位点通过调节光还原N2活化和还原的反应路径，提高目标氨产物的选择性和NH3生产力。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1080/29984475.2026.2748636","t":"Embedding Academic Literacies in Higher Education: A Qualitative Research Synthesis into Processes and Roles Within Embedding Initiatives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/29984475.2026.2748636","s":"Research Synthesis in Applied Linguistics","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The increasing need for academic literacy provision in higher education has led to discussion around how discipline-specific language can be embedded into curricula. While the Academic Literacies approach is commonly referenced in these discussions, few frameworks have been proposed regarding processes and roles involved in embedding initiatives. This qualitative research synthesis unveils the processes and roles reported in recent embedding initiatives, revealing a trend of EAP staff’s starting in the middle of the teaching cycle and the common practice of academic literacy provision being based around assessments. This leads to issues within the embedding process, especially surrounding the identification of discipline-specific literacies, their embedding into curricula and their teaching alongside content. The impact of the failure to consider academic literacies at curriculum design ","au":["Eddy Lawson"],"o":"日常","zt":"嵌入学术素养于高等教育：嵌入计划中过程与角色的定性研究综合","zb":"该定性研究综述揭示了学术英语教学（EAP）人员通常在教学周期中间开始工作，且学术素养提供常围绕评估展开。研究提出了Identify, Design, Teach (IDT)模型，促进EAP人员嵌入院系并参与课程与评估设计，从而成功识别学科特定素养并嵌入课程。IDT模型的优势在于学习目标、教学材料和评估之间的建设性对齐，以及有助于学生参与学科内容的学术素养提供。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07160k","t":"Hollow High-Entropy Oxide Spheres for Enhanced Electrocatalytic Nitrite-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07160k","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T02:59:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrite (NO 2 − ) to ammonia offers a compelling route to synergistically remediate nitrite-polluted wastewater and produce value-added NH 3 . However, its practical viability is constrained by the scarcity...","au":["Haifen Ding","Limin Song","Rong Hua","Yuxing Ma","Xuezhen Si","Youfeng Pan"],"o":"日常","zt":"用于增强电催化亚硝酸盐制氨的高熵空心氧化物球","zb":"针对亚硝酸盐还原制氨的实用性问题，制备了高熵空心氧化物球。该材料通过高熵效应和空心结构协同提升了电催化性能，为处理含氮废水及生产高附加值氨提供了有效途径。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c05096","t":"Rapid Synthesis of Fibrous Phosphorus for Ammonia Sensing at Room Temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c05096","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH3) is a representative reducing toxic gas whose rapid, low-concentration detection is important in constant-temperature, constant-humidity environments such as semiconductor cleanrooms, yet existing NH3 sensors often suffer from high operating temperatures or slow response/recovery kinetics. Fibrous phosphorus (FP), a layered allotrope of elemental phosphorus with a parallel tubular structure, is an appealing sensing candidate, but its efficient preparation and gas-sensing potential remain underexplored. Here, we report an iodine-assisted chemical vapor transport method that enables gram-scale synthesis of FP within 5 h with a yield exceeding 99%, without the need for precise temperature-gradient control. The key is the iodine-mediated cleavage of P4 cages and the directed assembly of active phosphorus fragments into tubular FP. Taking advantage of the weak interlayer","au":["Guangfu Luo","Junpeng Chen","Cong Ye","Pengtao Wang","Xishuo Zhang","Shuai Zhang"],"o":"日常","zt":"快速合成纤维状磷用于室温氨传感","zb":"氨（NH3）是一种典型的还原性有毒气体，其快速、低浓度检测在恒温恒湿环境（如半导体洁净室）中很重要，但现有的NH3传感器通常存在工作温度高或响应/恢复动力学慢的问题。纤维状磷（FP），磷元素的一种层状同素异形体，具有平行管状结构，是一种有吸引力的传感候选材料，但其高效制备和气敏潜力仍待探索。本研究报道了一种碘辅助化学气相传输方法，可在5小时内以超过99%的产率实现克级FP合成，无需精确的温度梯度控制。关键在于碘介导的P4笼的断裂和活性磷片段的定向组装成管状FP。利用弱的层间范德华相互作用，通过60分钟的冰浴剥离获得了高质量FP纳米带（FP-NRs），其平均宽度约为50 nm，平均长度约为6 μm，超过60%的带长宽比超过150。FP-NRs传感器在室温下对100 ppm NH3表现出826%的高响应，在90%标准下响应/恢复时间为31/7 s，在2 ppm NH3（响应69.8%）时仍保持","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mser.2026.101327","t":"Diatomic catalysts for nitrate electroreduction to ammonia: From reaction mechanism to scaled-up production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mser.2026.101327","s":"Materials Science and Engineering R Reports","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Shuo Zhang","Wenxin Wang","Hanqi Yu","Jiakun Zhang","Yan Li","Jing Wang"],"o":"日常","zt":"用于硝酸根电还原制氨的双原子催化剂：从反应机理到规模化生产","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c07178","t":"Synergistic Catalysis of Single-Site Rhenium and Ruthenium Nanoclusters for Ammonia Synthesis under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c07178","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Abstract The development of high-efficiency NH3 synthesis catalysts under mild conditions is urgently required to alleviate the excessive energy consumption and carbon emissions in traditional Haber–Bosch processes. Although Ru-based catalysts show considerable potential, their catalytic activity is often severely constrained by hydrogen poisoning caused by strong H2 adsorption. Herein, we report the fabrication of a Ba/0.1Re–Ru/AC catalyst through the strategic integration of single-atom Re species into a conventional Ba/Ru/AC framework. Notably, the Ba/0.1Re–Ru/AC catalyst exhibits a high NH3 synthesis rate of 65.1 mmol g–1 h–1 at 400 °C and 1 MPa. Mechanistic investigations reveal that single-atom Re species function as a supplementary active site for H2 adsorption and activation. The incorporation of Re also facilitates H-spillover over the catalyst surface, which effectively allevia","au":["Mingyuan Zhang","Depeng Zhang","Lei Zhang","Tianhua Zhang","Ming Chen","Xuanbei Peng"],"o":"日常","w":["Junling Lu","Lilong Jiang"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"温和条件下单原子铼和钌纳米团簇协同催化合成氨","zb":"通过将单原子铼物种整合到 Ba/Ru/AC 框架中制备了 Ba/0.1Re–Ru/AC 催化剂。该催化剂在 400 °C 和 1 MPa 下表现出 65.1 mmol g–1 h–1 的高氨合成速率。机制研究表明单原子铼作为 H2 吸附和活化的补充活性位点，促进 H 溢流并缓解氢中毒，同时调节载体缺陷密度和强金属-载体相互作用。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15011542/v1","t":"Comparative Magnetic Heating of Surface-Modified Ferrite Nanoparticles in Water and Agar Phantoms","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15011542/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study compares the alternating-magnetic-field (AMF) heating of Fe3O4-, MnFe2O4-, MgFe2O4-, and SrFe12O19-targeted nanoparticle preparations and of their sequentially silica-modified, aminated, Aufunctionalized, and PEG-treated forms. The compositions are identified by their nominal synthesis precursors. Temperature–time curves and the times required to reach 42 °C were measured in water and in nominally 1% agar phantoms under identical induction-generator settings (132 kHz; 5 kW rated output). Among the untreated preparations, the Mg-labeled series reached 42 °C fastest (145 s in water and 187 s in agar), whereas the Srlabeled series was the slowest (222 and 293 s, respectively). For the Mg-labeled particles, increasing the concentration from 2.5 to 10 mg mL 1 shortened the time to 42 °C from 394 to 77 s in water and from 381 to 112 - s in agar. In water, the aminated Mn-, Mg-, and ","au":["Aydın Evrim","Ayşesimay Çetin","Celaletdin Ergun","Ali Kılıç"],"o":"日常","why":["Magnetic Heat"],"zt":"水与琼脂模体中表面修饰铁氧体纳米粒子的比较磁加热","zb":"研究对比了 Fe3O4、MnFe2O4、MgFe2O4 和 SrFe12O19 纳米粒子及其表面修饰形式在 132 kHz 下的磁加热性能，发现 MgFe2O4 系列升温最快，表面氨基修饰可显著提升加热速率。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","pre":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-p1txk/v2","t":"Joule Heating Induced Structural Evolution of Ordered Mesoporous Mg-Al Spinel-Related Oxides","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-p1txk/v2","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Coupling block copolymer self-assembly with ultrafast Joule heating enables second-scale crystallization of ordered mesoporous oxides while preserving long-range mesoscopic order. Using this strategy, we synthesize long-range ordered mesoporous magnesium-aluminum oxide frameworks at low magnesium contents exhibiting defect spinel-related nanocrystalline structures. Ex situ isothermal holds at 1000 to 1155 °C reveal rapid crystallite enlargement followed by a plateau in apparent crystallite size. In pure γ-alumina, this early saturation, together with retention of the ordered mesostructure, is consistent with geometrically constrained crystallite growth. Magnesium incorporation enables further crystallite enlargement before saturation, yielding larger defect-spinel-related domains while retaining long-range mesoscopic order. We further demonstrate the incorporation of in situ crystallized","au":["Leyan Wang","Qihang Chen","Hossein Akhoundzadeh","Yong Quan Yeo","Geok Leng Seah","Yee Yan Tay"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zb":"利用超快闪蒸焦耳热耦合自组装策略，在保留长程介观有序的同时实现了有序介孔氧化物的秒级结晶。研究在低镁含量下合成了具有缺陷尖晶石相关纳米晶结构的有序介孔镁铝氧化物框架，并发现镁的掺入能显著促进晶粒生长。此外，该研究展示了铂纳米颗粒在框架内的原位结晶及其在350 °C下对甲基环己烷脱氢的活性。","ob":"其他催化反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/photonsci.6c00065","t":"Development of a Custom-Built Atomic Layer Deposition Reactor for In Situ Synchrotron GISAXS and XAS Characterization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/photonsci.6c00065","s":"Photon Science","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract This work presents the design, implementation, and validation of a custom-built in situ atomic layer deposition (ALD) reactor developed at the ALBA Synchrotron Light Source (Cerdanyola del Vallès, Spain), enabling direct integration with synchrotron X-ray beamlines. A modular configuration allows the ALD reactor to be deployed at two ALBA Synchrotron beamlines: NCD-SWEET beamline (BL11) for Grazing Incidence Small Angle X-ray Scattering (GISAXS) and NOTOS beamline (BL16) for X-ray Absorption Spectroscopy (XAS), requiring only minimal reconfiguration. The reactor performance was validated by in situ deposition of TiO2 thin films using titanium tetraisopropoxide (TTIP) and H2O as the precursor and co-reactant, respectively, with a growth per cycle (GPC) of 0.17 Å·cycle–1 at 150 °C. This system was chosen for its low growth rate, as a demanding test of detection sensitivity. In si","au":["Marina Armengol-Profitós","Jordi Prat Albert","Montserrat Prieto","Zbigniew Reszela","Cristián Huck-Iriart","Santiago Álvarez"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zb":"开发了一种可集成同步辐射光束线的模块化原位原子层沉积反应器，用于GISAXS和XAS表征。该系统在150 °C下沉积TiO2薄膜，生长速率为0.17 Å·cycle–1，并揭示了三种动力学生长阶段。原位GISAXS和XANES结合提供了薄膜形貌和生长动力学的综合图像。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.7471326","t":"Ammonia‐Gated Guanyl Hydrazone Photoisomerization Enables Sequential Solid‐State Optical Response in Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Frameworks","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7471326","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":13,"ab":"Embedding hydrazone photoswitches into hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks enables sequential, programmable macroscopic optical outputs. Ammonia exposure unlocks solid-state E / Z photoisomerization, which triggers a cascade reorganization of TPE packing to modulate coloration and luminescence, providing a design paradigm for high-security, information-dense smart photofunctional materials. ABSTRACT Light-driven molecular switches enable precise and noninvasive regulation of molecular structure and function, and thus represent fundamental building blocks for stimuli-responsive photofunctional materials. However, translating molecular-level photoswitching into sequence-dependent macroscopic outputs in the solid state remains a formidable challenge. In this study, we report a supramolecular strategy that integrates guanyl hydrazone switches into hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (HOFs) to ","au":["Weixu Feng","Dong Han","Jiamiao Yu","Zihang Tang","Yan Zhao","Wei Tian"],"o":"日常","zt":"氨气门控脲基腙光异构化实现氢键有机框架中的顺序固态光学响应","zb":"研究将脲基腙光开关引入氢键有机框架，利用酸碱刺激触发固态光异构化，诱导 TPE4- 堆积重排，从而实现对荧光和宏观显色的顺序可编程调控。","ob":"光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.3389/fceng.2026.1966277","t":"Multiscale modeling and industrial validation of the water-gas shift reactor in an ammonia unit using COMSOL multiphysics","u":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fceng.2026.1966277","s":"Frontiers in Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"The high temperature water-gas shift (HT-WGS) reaction is a central conversion step in ammonia production since it boosts the hydrogen yield and reduces the carbon monoxide content in the synthesis gas mixture before subsequent purification and ammonia synthesis. The industrial reactor was analyzed numerically with COMSOL Multiphysics 6.2. A three-dimensional model was created by combining momentum transport, heat transfer, multicomponent species transport, heterogeneous reaction kinetics, and intraparticle diffusion in porous Fe-Cr catalyst pellets under realistic adiabatic plant operating conditions. The novelty of the approach lies in combining industrial plant validation with simultaneous representation of reactor scale transport and pellet -scale diffusion-reaction processes. The model predictions were compared with the measured axial temperature profile and outlet gas composition o","au":["Suha Mahdi Salih","Dalia. S. Makki","Ali A. Abdulabbas","Hala Naseer Abdelkareem","Mahmod Abdulkarem Abdulqader"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"多尺度建模与工业验证：用于氨厂水煤气变换反应器的 COMSOL Multiphysics","zb":"研究对象为氨厂中的高温水煤气变换 (HT-WGS) 反应器，关键方法是使用 COMSOL Multiphysics 6.2 建立三维模型，结合动量传递、热传递、多组分物种传递、非均相反应动力学和多孔 Fe-Cr 催化剂颗粒内的扩散，在现实绝热工厂操作条件下进行数值分析。模型将工业装置验证与反应器尺度传递和颗粒尺度扩散-反应过程的同步表示相结合。模型预测与工业装置测量的轴向温度分布和出口气体组成进行了比较，温度的 MAE 为 3.50 K，R² 为 0.950，出口含量的 MAPE 为 5.30%。验证后的模型用于检查速度、温度、压力、气体组成、气-颗粒浓度和颗粒内浓度分布。参数分析评估了入口温度和蒸汽对 CO 比率对 CO 转化的影响。催化剂床的压力分布呈现近似线性下降，从 30 降至 28.35 bar。CO 和 H₂O 的摩尔分数沿反应床下降，而 CO₂ 和 H₂ 上升。提高入口温度将","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71791","t":"Light‐Induced Ce–Ov–Ni Motifs Enable Hydrogen‐Poisoning‐Resistant Photothermal NH3 Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71791","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Light irradiation dynamically generates oxygen vacancies at Ni/CeO 2 interfaces, forming Ce–Ov–Ni motifs that promote NH 3 adsorption and N–H activation while directing hydrogen intermediates to Ni sites. Vacancy-induced electronic modulation weakens H 2 adsorption, accelerates hydrogen release, mitigates hydrogen poisoning, and enables efficient low-temperature photothermal NH 3 -to-H 2 conversion. ABSTRACT NH 3 is an attractive hydrogen carrier, but efficient H 2 release is hindered by N–H bond cleavage and hydrogen poisoning. Herein, we develop Ni nanoparticle-supported CeO 2 (Ni/CeO 2 ) for low-temperature photothermal NH 3 decomposition. Light irradiation is accompanied by the dynamic generation of oxygen vacancies on CeO 2 , which couple with adjacent Ni sites to form Ce–Ov–Ni motifs, indicating that illumination can regulate the catalyst surface state beyond its thermal contributi","au":["Yue Zhu","Jianping Sheng","Chenyu Du","Ye He","Chaowei Yuan","Yanjuan Sun"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 Decomposition"],"zt":"光诱导 Ce–Ov–Ni 模式实现抗氢中毒光热 NH3 分解","zb":"研究开发了负载 Ni 纳米粒子的 CeO2 催化剂用于低温光热 NH3 分解。光照在 CeO2 表面动态生成氧空位，与相邻 Ni 位点形成 Ce–Ov–Ni 模式。实验和 DFT 计算表明，该界面促进了 NH3 吸附和 N–H 激活，同时通过电子调制减弱 H2 吸附。在 450°C 下，10 wt.% Ni/CeO2 的 NH3 转化率达 96.3%，且在 50 小时内保持 >95% 的转化率。","ob":"通用催化方法","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.3751410","t":"Ligand‐Directed Nitrate Incorporation Into Reconstructed Oxyhydroxides for Durable Seawater Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.3751410","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Nitro functional group was incorporated into NiFe-MOF ligands near metal sites, which undergo a simple and direct oxidation to NO 3 − and subsequently anchored on the reconstructed γ-NiFeOOH phase. The anchored NO 3 − not only forms a robust Cl − -repelling interface but also activates lattice oxygen to drive the efficient lattice-oxygen-mediated pathway for active and durable seawater electrolysis. ABSTRACT Chloride ions (Cl − )-induced corrosion severely limits the practical implementation of direct seawater electrolysis. Although oxyanion incorporation can mitigate Cl − poisoning, existing approaches offer limited control over oxyanion generation and retention during catalyst reconstruction. Herein, we report a MOF-based ligand-engineering strategy that enables defined oxyanion incorporation into reconstructed metal oxyhydroxides for active and durable seawater electrolysis. Nitro- (N","au":["Huangcong Tang","Jieting Ding","Zemin Feng","Jiarui Ding","Shunchun Yao","Hao‐Fan Wang"],"o":"日常","zt":"配体定向硝酸盐掺入重建羟基氧化物用于耐海水电解","zb":"研究对象为 NiFe-MOF 配体工程策略，关键方法是引入硝基官能团到靠近金属位点的配体中，在电化学重建过程中直接氧化为 NO₃⁻ 并锚定在重建的 γ-NiFeOOH 相上。锚定的 NO₃⁻ 不仅形成坚固的 Cl⁻ 防护界面，还激活晶格氧，驱动高效的晶格氧介导的海水电解路径。设计的催化剂在碱性海水中实现了优异的析氧反应性能，在 500 mA cm −2 的电流密度下过电位仅为 230 mV，优于无 NO₃⁻ 对应物。它还表现出高耐久性，在 1.5 A cm −2 下运行超过 4000 小时，降解速率为 1.8 µV h −1。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.2196422","t":"Electron Bridge Enhanced Charge Polarization Enables Efficient and Ultra‐Long Stable Urea Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2196422","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"An electron bridge strategy is developed to regulate charge polarization in Pd 1 and Ni 1 dual single-atom sites, promoting CO 2 reduction, nitrate reduction, and C–N coupling simultaneously. The resulting catalyst achieves efficient urea electrosynthesis with high activity and record durability over 1700 h. ABSTRACT Urea electrosynthesis from carbon dioxide and nitrates powered by green electricity is a zero-carbon route for urea production. Simultaneously achieving high activity and long-term stability is a prerequisite for the industrialization of urea electrosynthesis. In this study, we propose an electron bridge strategy based on a Pd 1 and Ni 1 dual single-atom alloy to boost the electrocatalytic activity and durability for urea electrosynthesis. The single-atom Ni 1 sites act as electron bridges to promote charge transfer from Cu to Pd 1 sites, leading to charge-polarized Pd–Cu si","au":["Fan Wu","Haixia Wang","Wei Wang","Junrong Zou","Ruijie Zhou","Fenglin Xie"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"电子桥增强电荷极化实现高效和超长稳定尿素电合成","zb":"研究对象为 Pd₁ 和 Ni₁ 双单原子合金催化剂，关键方法是提出基于电子桥策略的电荷极化调节，促进 CO₂ 还原、硝酸盐还原和 C-N 耦合。该催化剂在 1700 小时内实现了高效的尿素电合成，具有高活性和记录耐久性，尿素产率速率为 541.6 mmol g cat −1 h −1，尿素法拉第效率为 57.3%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.46427/gold2026.35918","t":"Legacy herbicides modulate nitrite partitioning and nitrogen retention during nitrate reduction in anoxic subsurface systems","u":"https://doi.org/10.46427/gold2026.35918","s":"Goldschmidt 2026 abstracts","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Bastien Redon","Mark Altabet","Mathilde Monperrus","Melanie Longchamp","Marie Morere","Mathieu Sebilo"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"遗留除草剂调节厌氧地下系统中硝酸盐还原期间亚硝酸盐分配和氮保留","bt":1},{"id":"10.46427/gold2026.35845","t":"Iron-mediated nitrite reduction as a major sink of reactive nitrogen across contrasting lakes","u":"https://doi.org/10.46427/gold2026.35845","s":"Goldschmidt 2026 abstracts","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Rosanna Margalef Marti","Mathieu Sebilo","Aubin Thibault de Chanvalon","Pierre Anschutz","David Amouroux"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrite reduction"],"zt":"铁介导的亚硝酸盐还原作为不同湖泊中活性氮的主要汇","bt":1},{"id":"10.2118/235870-ms","t":"Treatment of Petrochemical VOCs by In-Site Non-Catalytic Reduction of Nitrogen Oxides in Incineration Process","u":"https://doi.org/10.2118/235870-ms","s":"ADIPEC","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T02:28:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Volatile organic compounds (VOCs) are flammable and some of them are hazardous to human health. Apart from its toxic nature, VOCs can also take part into photochemical reactions and contribute to formation of ozone and fine particles, causing detrimental influences on atmospheric quality. Increase in VOCs emission from human activity has been recognized as primary causes of urban air pollution in China, and targeted control and constant removal of VOCs was proposed as key measures to mitigate atmosphere problems. Petrochemical facility was significant emission sources for VOCs and NOx and represents an possibility of co-treatment of these two pollutants. In this work, treatment of petrochemical VOCs by directing VOCs stream into facility heater or process furnace was proposed and confirmed. The oxidation of VOCs and its influence on NOx conversion was probed within an experiment","au":["D. D. Cao","M. Xue","X. C. Li","X. Y. Cui"],"o":"日常","why":["Reduction of Nitrogen"],"zt":"利用焚烧过程中原位非催化还原氮氧化物处理石化 VOCs","zb":"针对石化行业 VOCs 和 NOx 共同排放问题，提出将 VOCs 流股引入加热炉或工艺炉进行协同处理。实验模拟了丙烷和丙烯在 200–800 mg/m3 NO 浓度下的共转化过程，结果表明在 300°C 以上温度下 VOCs 可选择性还原 NO，且在 500°C 以下有利于 NO 还原，在 700°C 以上 VOCs 被完全消耗。"},{"id":"10.1149/1945-7111/aebcb9","t":"pH-Universal Electrocatalytic Nitrate-to-Ammonia Reduction on Ruthenium-Decorated Copper Foam","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/1945-7111/aebcb9","s":"Journal of The Electrochemical Society","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic reduction reaction of nitrate to ammonia (NO3RR) has emerged as a promising strategy that couples nitrate pollutant remediation with sustainable NH3 production. Practical nitrate-containing industrial wastewater usually presents a wide pH distribution range, which puts forward an urgent requirement for pH-adaptive NO₃RR catalysts with high ammonia selectivity. Conventional NO3RR catalysts fail to deliver high NH3 Faradaic efficiency under extreme acidic or alkaline conditions, mainly due to uncontrollable competitive adsorption of hydrogen intermediates on active sites. Herein, we report a ruthenium-decorated copper foam catalyst (RuCuF@PUS) fabricated via a facile two-step electrodeposition method, which achieves exceptional NO3RR performance across a wide pH window of 1-12. The interconnected porous framework enables efficient mass transfer, while the precisel","au":["Siqi Xing","Xu Wu"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"铀修饰铜泡沫上 pH 通用电催化硝酸盐到氨还原","zb":"报道了一种通过两步电极沉积法制备的铀修饰铜泡沫催化剂 RuCuF@PUS，实现了 1-12 宽 pH 范围内的卓越 NO3RR 性能。该催化剂在酸性条件下于 −0.4 V vs RHE 下实现了 457.56 µmol/h·cm2 的氨产率率和 90.96% 的峰值法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta06451e","t":"Beyond the Haber-Bosch Process: Design of Efficient Electrocatalysts for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta06451e","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In spite of considerable work to produce ammonia using technologies beyond the energyintensive and costly Haber-Bosch process, finding efficient and earth-abundant catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) remains a...","au":["Erakulan E. Siddharthan","Mehmet Emin Kilic","Puru Jena"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"超越哈伯-博施过程：高效电催化合成氨电催化剂的设计","zb":"尽管在利用超越哈伯-博施过程生产氨方面进行了大量工作，但寻找高效且地球丰富的电催化氮还原反应电催化剂仍然是一个挑战。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c16760","t":"Structural Reconstruction of Ternary CuCo2S4 for Boosting Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c16760","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO3RR) represents a promising strategy for sustainable ammonia synthesis while simultaneously addressing nitrate pollution in wastewater. However, the irreversible structural reconstruction commonly observed in catalysts during NO3RR obscures the true active sites and complicates mechanistic understanding. In this study, flower-like CuCo2S4 nanocrystals synthesized via a hot-injection method serve as a model ternary sulfide system to systematically probe reconstruction dynamics and identify active phases under operating conditions. Experimental characterizations reveal that CuCo2S4 gradually evolves into Cu-Co(OH)2/Co9S8 through electrochemical reconstruction. This reconstructed catalyst exhibits excellent NO3RR performance, achieving an average Faradaic efficiency of 97.3%, an ammonia production rate of 363.1 μmol h–1 mg–1, and rem","au":["Haixia Liu","Xing Chen","Yan Wang","Youzhi Yang","Lijun Hu","Yue Chen"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于促进电催化硝酸盐还原制氨的三元 CuCo2S4 结构重构","zb":"利用热注射法合成的花状 CuCo2S4 纳米晶作为模型三元硫化物体系，系统研究了电催化过程中的重构动力学。实验表征显示 CuCo2S4 逐渐重构为 Cu-Co(OH)2/Co9S8，该重构催化剂在 NO3RR 中表现出优异性能，平均法拉第效率达 97.3%，氨产率为 363.1 μmol h–1 mg–1。原位 FTIR 和 DFT 计算表明 Cu 掺杂促进了 *NO2 转化并加速后续氢化步骤，同时优化了 NO3– 吸附与 *NH3 解吸的平衡。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127729","t":"In-to-out compressive strain in 2D-on-3D NiOOH/NiCu optimizes H supply for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction and high-performance Zn-Nitrate batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127729","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yushan Chen","Zhiwen Cheng","Zhujun Liu","Chenyu Bao","Shuxun Chen","Feihuang Zheng"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"2D-on-3D NiOOH/NiCu中的内向压缩应变优化电催化硝酸盐还原和高性能Zn-硝酸盐电池的H供应","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/elt2.70075","t":"Synergistic CNT‐Integrated Ni‐Phthalocyanine/g‐C 3 N 4 Heterojunctional Photocatalysts With Single Ni–N 4 (II) Sites for Efficient Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/elt2.70075","s":"Electron","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The photochemical reduction of nitrogen offers an environmentally friendly approach for ammonia synthesis, providing an alternative to the energy‐intensive and emission‐heavy Haber–Bosch process. Despite its promise, the process is impeded by slow nitrogen activation and excessive hydrogen evolution. To overcome these limitations, we present a tandem nickel phthalocyanine (NiPc)/CNT‐P&Cu‐BCN photocatalyst, engineered with an organic–organic heterojunction for enhanced nitrogen conversion. This system integrates boron‐doped (B), nitrogen‐deficient (N) carbon nitride (CN), modified via Cu–Cu coordination and phosphorus doping through sodium borohydride‐assisted thermal treatment, with hydrogen‐bonded, ultrathin NiPc nanosheets. This novel design yields a record ammonia production rate of 915.4 μmol g −1 h −1 under visible light, a remarkable 16‐fold increase compared to traditiona","au":["Imran Khan","Khaled Alsaikhan","Habib Khemira","Atef El Jery","Anam Iqbal","Kanwal Iqbal"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"协同 CNT 集成的 Ni-酞菁/g-C₃N₄ 异质结光催化剂与单 Ni-N₄(II) 位点用于高效氨合成","zb":"研究对象为串联镍酞菁 (NiPc)/CNT-P&Cu-BCN 光催化剂，关键方法是设计有机-有机异质结以增强氮转化。该系统集成了硼掺杂 (B)、氮缺位 (N) 的碳氮 (CN)，通过 Cu-Cu 配位和磷掺杂（通过硼氢化钠辅助热处理）改性，与氢键结合的、超薄的 NiPc 纳米片。该新型设计在可见光下实现了 915.4 μmol g −1 h −1 的记录氨产率，比传统 BCN 材料提高了 16 倍。改进归因于精确的带隙工程；硼掺杂和氮空位调整电子结构，而 Cu、P 和 CNT 的协同效应增强电荷转移动力学。超薄 NiPc 框架引入了原子分散的活性位点，而 Z 方案驱动的电荷分离机制促进了高效的电子移动。这项工作通过集成缺陷工程、异质结设计和单原子催化，为光催化氮固定的发展提供了新见解，为可持续氨生产提供了一种可扩展的途径。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/adsc.70858","t":"CoTCPP‐Modified Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 for Efficient Photocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsc.70858","s":"Advanced Synthesis & Catalysis","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia holds dual significance for nitrogen‐containing wastewater remediation and green ammonia synthesis. However, single‐component semiconductor photocatalysts are generally hampered by severe photogenerated charge recombination, insufficient spectral response, and poor substrate activation. Herein, cobalt porphyrin (CoTCPP) was in situ anchored onto the surface of Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 nanorods via a solvothermal method to construct CoTCPP/Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 photocatalysts featuring strong interfacial coupling. X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) analysis reveals a distinct interfacial electronic coupling between CoTCPP and Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 . This strong interfacial coupling synergistically enhances photocatalytic performance by facilitating rapid capture and efficient interfacial transfer of photogenerated electrons to effectively suppress charge carrier","au":["Yanting Liu","Zhiwei Shao","Shaofa Ma","Jun Xiong","Wei Jiang","Jun Di"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"CoTCPP 修饰的 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 用于高效光催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为 CoTCPP/Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 光催化剂，关键方法是使用溶剂热法将钴卟啉 (CoTCPP) 原位锚定在 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 纳米棒表面，构建具有强界面耦合的光催化剂。XPS 分析揭示了 CoTCPP 和 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 之间的独特界面电子耦合。这种强界面耦合通过促进光生电子的快速捕获和高效界面转移协同增强光催化性能，有效抑制电荷载体复合，显著拓宽近红外 (NIR) 光响应范围，并增强催化剂表面的 NO₃⁻ 静电吸附，加速 NH₃ 的选择性生成。优化的 1.5CoTCPP/Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 实现了 1230.81 μmol·g −1 ·h −1 的 NH₃ 产率，约为原始 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 的 5 倍。原位傅里叶变换红外光谱证实了 NO₃⁻ → *NO₃ → *NO₂ → *NO → *NHOH → *NH₂OH → NH₃ 的逐步去氧-加氢还原路径。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.46427/gold2026.36360","t":"Hydrogen Looping During Electrolysis of Wastewater Filtrate for Ammonia Recovery","u":"https://doi.org/10.46427/gold2026.36360","s":"Goldschmidt 2026 abstracts","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Victoria Mills","Nora Conzemius"],"o":"日常","zt":"废水滤液电解制氨过程中的氢循环","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.2118/235635-ms","t":"From Concept to Bankability: Scalable Floating Green Ammonia FPSO Development with Integrated Safety Design","u":"https://doi.org/10.2118/235635-ms","s":"ADIPEC","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T02:28:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Green ammonia projects face increasing challenges in progressing from conceptual development toward bankable execution, requiring coordinated development across technology, infrastructure, safety assurance, and commercial pathways. This paper presents the outcome of an ongoing front-end development program for a compact floating green ammonia FPSO-type facility. It discusses how mature technologies can be selected for floating applications, modularized, marinized, and integrated with safety-led design to support a scalable and bankable infrastructure model. The development incorporates contributions from the project developer, the design and fabrication contractor, and an independent classification and technical assurance partner. Market-driven design considerations include renewable power availability, geographical location, export route, and potential offtake markets. The tech","au":["Sookkwan Tang","Iain Macleod","Li Ma","Conn Fagan","Sebastien Cochet"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"从概念到可执行性：集成安全设计的可扩展浮动绿氨 FPSO 开发","zb":"针对绿氨项目从概念开发走向可执行面临的挑战，本文介绍了紧凑型浮动绿氨 FPSO 型设施的端前开发成果。该设施集成了约 500 MW 可再生电力、高压配电、制氢、制氮、氨合成、制冷储存及海上卸载接口，并通过 HAZID、定量风险评估等安全研究，展示了如何将技术就绪度、商业就绪度和安全监管就绪度同步成熟化。"},{"id":"10.1080/00963402.2026.2745433","t":"Opinion: Why the annual Ig Nobel Prize ceremony is now in Europe","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00963402.2026.2745433","s":"Bulletin of the Atomic Scientists","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Marc Abrahams"],"o":"日常","zt":"观点：为什么年度诺贝尔奖荒诞奖颁奖典礼现在在欧洲","ob":"通用催化方法","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsestwater.6c01131","t":"Interpretable Machine Learning for Biochar Ammonium Nitrogen Adsorption: Decoupling Synthesis and Operational Drivers and Quantifying Optimal Design Rules","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsestwater.6c01131","s":"ACS ES&T Water","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Predicting the ammonium nitrogen (NH4+-N) adsorption capacity of biochar is challenged by coupled, nonlinear interactions among operational variables, pyrolysis synthesis parameters, and intrinsic material properties. A unified data set comprising 425 literature-reported adsorption records from 18 studies was compiled, and preprocessing (KNN imputation and Z-score standardization) was fitted exclusively on the training subset to prevent data leakage. Among seven machine learning algorithms benchmarked with Bayesian optimization and 5-fold cross-validation, XGBoost achieved the highest test-set coefficient of determination (R2) of 0.901 and root-mean-square error of 0.555 mg g–1. TreeSHAP analysis quantitatively decoupled three driver groups, adsorption operational parameters (53.3%), biochar physicochemical properties (38.2%), and pyrolysis synthesis parameters (8.5%), and ident","au":["Chunxian Huang","Meiwen Zhu","Ling Wu","Binghua Zhou","Zhipeng Wang","Zheng-Hong Huang"],"o":"日常","zt":"生物炭铵氮吸附的可解释机器学习：解耦合成与操作驱动因素及量化最优设计规则","zb":"针对生物炭铵氮吸附容量预测中变量间复杂的非线性耦合问题，构建了包含 425 条文献记录的统一数据集。通过贝叶斯优化和 5 折交叉验证，XGBoost 算法在测试集上取得了 R2 为 0.901 的最佳性能。TreeSHAP 分析定量解耦了吸附操作参数（53.3%）、生物炭理化性质（38.2%）和热解合成参数（8.5%）三个驱动组，确定了初始浓度、生物炭氧含量和吸附剂用量为主导变量。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.183893","t":"FJH-assisted construction of 3D graphene conductive networks for synergistically enhancing cycling stability and high-rate performance of lithium iron phosphate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.183893","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xiaoyuan Sang","Shikai Liu","Eswaramoorthi Thirugnanasambandam","Huimin Jiang","Liyan Zhou","Ziping Jin"],"o":"日常","why":["FJH"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热辅助构建三维石墨烯导电网络以协同增强磷酸铁锂的循环稳定性和高倍率性能","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/molecules31213938","t":"Turning NOx Pollutants into Green Ammonia Fuel via COF Cavity Confinement","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules31213938","s":"Molecules","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"The development of sustainable fuels and hydrogen carriers is essential for a carbon-neutral energy future. Ammonia (NH3) is a promising energy vector, yet its synthesis remains dependent on the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process, while nitrogen oxides (NOx) persist as major atmospheric pollutants. In this work, spin-polarized density functional theory (DFT) calculations at the MPWB1K/def2SVP level are used to investigate the capture and reduction of NO and NO2 within a rigid covalent organic framework (M1). Nucleus-Independent Chemical Shift (NICS) analysis reveals a strongly aromatic shielding character (NICS = −10.8) that provides a unique electronic environment, while electrostatic potential (ESP) mapping illustrates local electron density. Confinement within the framework suppresses competing pathways that preferentially favor the pathway toward NH3 and H2O. Activation barriers ar","au":["Marlene Bosquez","Roberto Salcedo"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过 COF 空腔限制将 NOx 污染物转化为绿色氨燃料","zb":"研究利用自旋极化密度泛函理论计算，探究了刚性共价有机框架 M1 对 NO 和 NO2 的捕获与还原，发现空腔限制显著降低了活化能，促进了 N-O 键断裂生成 NH3。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116400","t":"DFT screening of MN4-doped C54 fullerenes as single-atom catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116400","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-01T02:11:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Chenkun Li","Tongmeng Xing","Qiuyan Xiang","Junkai Xu","A.J.C. Varandas","Jing Li"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"MN4 掺杂 C54 富勒烯作为电催化氮还原反应单原子催化剂的 DFT 筛选","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/chem.71875","t":"Synergistic Effect of RuNi Bimetallic Nanoparticles Immobilized on Ceria as Catalysts for Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.71875","s":"Chemistry – A European Journal","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT The production of hydrogen from chemical hydrides has garnered significant interest as a sustainable method for producing clean energy. The hydrolysis of ammonia borane (NH 3 BH 3 , AB) under mild reaction conditions was assessed in this work using a highly active Ru–Ni alloy catalyst supported on CeO 2 . As‐synthesized Ru–Ni/CeO 2 with different metal contents was used as a heterogeneous catalyst for the mild hydrolytic dehydrogenation of AB. At 298 K, the optimal catalyst is Ru 0.5 Ni 1.25 /CeO 2 , which demonstrated exceptional catalytic activity with a TOF value of 1226.0 mol H2 min − 1 . The calculated apparent activation energy was 37.5 kJ mol −1 , which is even lower than that of the majority of noble‐metal‐based catalysts for AB dehydrogenation. Strong electronic interactions and synergistic effects between Ru and Ni led to the formation of a bimetallic alloy structure w","au":["Abbas Al‐nayili","Ahmed Nasser Taaima"],"o":"日常","zt":"负载于氧化铈上用于氨硼烷水解协同效应的 RuNi 双金属纳米颗粒催化剂","zb":"利用负载于 CeO2 上的 Ru–Ni 合金催化剂评估了氨硼烷在温和条件下的水解产氢性能。最优催化剂 Ru0.5Ni1.25/CeO2 在 298 K 下表现出卓越活性，TOF 值为 1226.0 mol H2 min–1，表观活化能为 37.5 kJ mol–1。Ru 与 Ni 之间的强电子相互作用和协同效应增强了催化活性，CeO2 的强金属-载体相互作用和高氧存储容量提高了纳米颗粒的分散性和稳定性。","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.125572","t":"Hybrid ammonia synthesis mechanism on CeRuSi intermetallic originating from Ce-Ru-Si electronic synergy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.125572","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"","au":["Hongping Yan","Yuying Cheng","Yaoqi Xie","Yifei Nie","Yuanjin Li","Shijing Liang"],"o":"日常","w":["Lilong Jiang"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 Ce-Ru-Si 电子协同作用的 CeRuSi 金属间化合物上氨合成的混合机理","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfcoat.2026.134133","t":"Baffle-induced deagglomeration enables uniform nanoparticle coating in rotary atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfcoat.2026.134133","s":"Surface and Coatings Technology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Junren Xiang","Mingxuan Wang","Xiao Liu","Wenqing Wang","Jiahao Chen","Bin Shan"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"挡板诱导的解团聚实现旋转原子层沉积中的均匀纳米颗粒涂层","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2026.141936","t":"Rapid synthesis of B/N co-doped porous carbon from corn stover via flash joule heating for zinc ion hybrid capacitors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2026.141936","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zichun Wang","Baojun Tong","Lijie Wang","Zixuan Li","Xiaopeng Liu","Feng Wei"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"利用闪蒸焦耳热从玉米秸秆快速合成 B/N 共掺杂多孔碳用于锌离子混合电容器","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jiec.2026.11.006","t":"Pulsed magnetic induction heating for catalyst regeneration in continuous Fixed-Bed Reactors: Extending operational stability in antibiotic removal","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jiec.2026.11.006","s":"Journal of Industrial and Engineering Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Sergio Fernández-Velayos","Alberto París-Rodrigo","Jorge Sánchez-Marcos","Eva Mazarío"],"o":"日常","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"脉冲磁感应加热用于连续固定床反应器中的催化剂再生：延长抗生素去除的操作稳定性","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jaap.2026.108241","t":"Carbon Evolution during Flash Joule Heating of Waste Tire Rubber: Methane Preservation versus Graphene Reconstruction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaap.2026.108241","s":"Journal of Analytical and Applied Pyrolysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Mingfan Zhang","Tong Xu","Dikun Hong","Yao Zhang","Shuai Ning","Chunbo Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"废轮胎橡胶闪蒸焦耳加热过程中的碳演化：甲烷保存与石墨烯重构","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184066","t":"Flash joule heating for solid waste valorization and environmental remediation: From reactor design to sustainability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184066","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zixuan Li","Chengze Yu","Mingxiao Li","Bing Deng","Beidou Xi","Jiaqi Hou"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热用于固体废物增值与环境修复：从反应器设计到可持续性","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2026.111204","t":"First-Principles Mechanistic Insights into Dual-Metal Synergy for Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction on Graphene with Paired Monovacancies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2026.111204","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Anand Mohan Verma","Nanda Kishore"],"o":"日常","why":["Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction"],"zt":"基于石墨烯的配对单空位双金属协同电化学氮还原的第一性原理机制洞察","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144152","t":"Interlayer Single-Metal-Atom Coordinated Porous Boron Nitride: Triggering p-d-p Orbital Hybridization for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate to Ammonia Reduction.","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144152","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yaqi Yang","Shiyu Chen","Jiameng Gong","Lanlan Li","Chengfeng Li","Qiaoling Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"层间单金属原子配位多孔氮化硼：触发 p-d-p 轨道杂化以实现高效的电催化硝酸盐到氨还原","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144099","t":"Engineering the electronic structure of LaCoO3 nanofibers via Cu doping for efficient electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144099","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Bingyan Shi","Mingze Xia","Siqi Zhang","Cheng Fan","Shengji Tian","Chade Lv"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过 Cu 掺杂工程化 LaCoO3 纳米纤维的电子结构以实现高效电催化合成氨","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.046","t":"Modulating d-d orbital hybridization in Fe-Co dual-atom catalysts reconfigures nitrogen reduction pathways for efficient ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.046","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qirui Li","Yongfang Zhang","Cong Han","Pan Chen","Xiaokun Yang","Ying Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"调节Fe-Co双原子催化剂的d-d轨道杂化重新配置氮还原路径以实现高效的氨电合成","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141916","t":"Morphology and Electronic Structure Modulation of Cu-Doped Co₃O₄/rGO Nanosheets for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate-to-Ammonia Upcycling and Onsite Chalcone Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141916","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO₃RR) offers a promising route for ammonia synthesis, but is hindered by slow kinetics and competitive hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Herein, ultrathin Cu‐doped Co₃O₄/reduced graphene oxide (Cu‐Co₃O₄/rGO) nanosheets are prepared through the morphology and electronic structure modulation for efficient NO₃RR performance. Combined experiments and DFT computations disclose that Cu doping induces 2D nanosheet morphology, up-modulates the d‐band center to optimize the adsorption strengthen of reactants and key intermediates, and constructs Cu‐Co tandem sites for cascade catalysis, while rGO improves the composite conductivity. The optimized catalyst exhibits a Faradaic efficiency of 98.5% at -0.7 V vs. RHE and an ammonia yield of 25.2 mg h-¹ mgcat-¹ at -1.0 V vs. RHE with high stability. The in‐situ electro‐generated ammonia acts directly as a base cata","au":["Ling-Ling Shan","Jing-Jing Liang","Shao-Wei Bian"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu掺杂Co₃O₄/rGO纳米片的形貌与电子结构调控用于高效电催化硝酸盐-氨升级与原位查尔酮合成","zb":"通过Cu掺杂调控形貌和电子结构构建Cu-Co串联位点，优化了反应物和中间体的吸附强度，所得催化剂在-1.0 V vs. RHE下氨产率为25.2 mg h-¹ mgcat-¹，原位生成的氨直接作为查尔酮合成的催化剂。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141853","t":"Dynamic hydrogen-storage reservoir in ruthenium–hydrogen tungsten bronze for highly efficient photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141853","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic N 2 fixation is a promising route for sustainable ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis. Its efficiency depends on light absorption, charge separation, and active sites. Hydrogen tungsten bronze (H x WO 3 ; HWO) exhibits distinct advantages for nitrogen (N 2 ) fixation owing to its broad ultraviolet-visible-near-infrared light absorption and abundant oxygen vacancies. Nevertheless, the structural instability originating from the extraction of lattice hydrogen during catalysis severely restricts its practical applicability. Herein, we report the design of a hydrogen extraction and insertion dynamic ruthenium (Ru)-supported HWO (Ru/HWO) system for stable and efficient photocatalytic N 2 fixation. During the reaction, the release of lattice hydrogen from HWO accelerates the N 2 reduction reaction. Active hydrogen species are generated at the water-dissociation sites on Ru spillover to HW","au":["Jie Yuan","Jianyu Xiao","Qian Xia","Guihua Luo","Xinwei Cui","Xu Sun"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"动态氢存储库在钌-氢钨青铜中用于高效光催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为钌-氢钨青铜（Ru/HWO）体系，关键方法为设计动态氢提取和插入系统，通过闪蒸焦耳热加速N2还原反应，在Ru溢流到HWO的水解位点生成活性氢物种，实现228.5 μmol g-1 h-1的氨产率，光利用范围从紫外到红外。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.isci.2026.118154","t":"Highly twinned cobalt selenide with abundant selenium vacancies for efficient nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2026.118154","s":"iScience","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) offers a promising approach to produce ammonia (NH3) under ambient conditions. However, the ammonia yield rate and Faradaic efficiency were still limited by the chemical inertness of nitrogen. Here, we report the introduction of Se vacancies in CoSe nanorods via an ions-exchange method. Se vacancies can improve the NRR activities by the lending of N2 activation. As a result, the ammonia yield rate reached as high as 106.7 μg h–1 mg–1 with a Faradaic efficiency of 21.2% at -0.3 V (vs. RHE). More importantly, the ammonia is directly derived from nitrogen, which was demonstrated by the isotopic experiments using 15N2 as a nitrogen source. This work not only provides a strategy for creating Se vacancies, but also offers an important pathway for the development of efficient catalysts for NRR. Ammonia (NH3) golds significant importance as carb","au":["Li Shang","Can Li","Sui Zhang","Kangwen Qiu"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"具有丰富硒空位的孪晶钴硒化物用于高效的氮还原反应","zb":"通过离子交换法在CoSe纳米棒中引入硒空位，利用硒空位促进N2活化，在-0.3 V下实现了106.7 μg h–1 mg–1的氨产率和21.2%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158418","t":"Continuous ammonia production via solar-biomass integration: Annual 4E performance and economic viability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158418","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mohammad Hossein Jahangir","Ali MohammadAlizadeh","Abtin Tabrizi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过太阳能生物质一体化实现连续氨生产：年度4E性能和经济可行性","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158417","t":"Flexible ammonia synthesis: A techno-economic analysis of operational limits in the Haber-Bosch loop","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158417","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Cecilia Pistolesi","Claudia Bassano","Alberto Giaconia","Marcello De Falco"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"柔性氨合成：哈伯-博施循环中操作极限的技术经济分析","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.comptc.2026.116140","t":"Ammonia production through N2 reduction via transition metals decorated boron phosphide nanocage based single atom catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.comptc.2026.116140","s":"Computational and Theoretical Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Naveen Kosar","Tariq Mahmood","Abdulaziz A. Al-Saadi"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia production"]},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.183777","t":"Fe-induced local coordination reconstruction of MoB2 for selective nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.183777","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jingya Ding","Feng Cheng","Wenlin Zeng","Qi Xu","Sheng Han","Yiwei Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"Fe诱导的MoB2局部配位重构用于选择性硝酸盐-氨电合成","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.183530","t":"A sustainable path towards nitrogen purification for ammonia production: Experimental demonstration of thermochemical air separation in a packed-bed reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.183530","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Conventional ammonia synthesis relies on steam methane reforming (SMR) to produce hydrogen while concurrently supplying high-purity nitrogen as a by-product for the Haber-Bosch process. However, the shift to green ammonia, where hydrogen is produced via electrolysis, eliminates this nitrogen source, necessitating an energy-efficient air separation unit (ASU) to prevent catalyst poisoning from O 2 impurities below 10 ppm. Pressure swing adsorption units face prohibitive energy penalties when targeting such ultra-low impurities, as energy demand escalates exponentially below 1 vol% O 2 . To overcome this scalability barrier, we demonstrate a thermochemical redox cycle using SrFeO 3 (SFO) integrated with ASU pre-purification for the first time. Our 6.5 kg packed-bed reactor achieves 450 °C restricts purity to ≥ 2 ppm due to thermodynamic limitations. A purified nitrogen flow of up to 0.35 k","au":["Nicole Carina Neumann","Lena Klaas","Dorottya Kriechbaumer","Bruno Lachmann","Fabio Pierno","Dorothea Kaunzner"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"一条可持续的氮纯化途径用于氨生产：填充床反应器中热化学空气分离的实验验证","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2026.116060","t":"Strategies for controlling nitrogen accumulation in direct reduced iron catalyst during ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2026.116060","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jae Min Park","Seungbeom Yoon","Sangwook Joo","Gihun Kwon","Hojin Lee","Hai Woong Park"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"控制直接还原铁催化剂在氨分解过程中氮积累的策略","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127780","t":"APTES-mediated Fe-N coordination modulates electronic structure of Fe single-atom for selective photocatalytic nitrate reduction to N2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127780","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xia Zhang","Jiaxin Han","Tiemei Li","Guifen Zhu","Jing Fan"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"APTES介导的Fe-N配位调控Fe单原子选择性光催化还原硝酸盐至N2的电子结构","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127755","t":"Tailoring Zeolite Acidity to Regulate Dynamic NH3 Adsorption-Desorption for Enhanced Plasma-Catalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127755","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Weitao Wang","Chunqiang Lu","Jens-Peter B. Haraldsted","Josephine Digné","Erik Wisaeus","Bianca Rolim"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"调控沸石酸度以调节动态NH3吸附-解吸以增强等离子体催化氨合成","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.192210","t":"Constructing CoNi alloy/high-entropy oxide heterojunctions via selective surface reduction for rapid visible-light-driven ammonia borane methanolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.192210","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Yufeng Jiang","Jingjing Deng","Xiaodong Chen","Zemin Huang","Yi Lin","Yanrui He"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过选择性表面还原构建CoNi合金/高熵氧化物异质结用于快速可见光驱动氨硼烷甲醇解","ob":"氨硼烷水解｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jacomc.2026.100312","t":"Magnetically Recoverable Rhodium Nanoparticles on NiFe2O4: Efficient Catalytic System for Hydrogen Evolution from Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jacomc.2026.100312","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds Communications","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Serdar Akbayrak","Saim Özkar"],"o":"日常","zt":"磁性可回收的铑纳米颗粒负载在 NiFe2O4 上：高效的氨硼烷水解制氢催化体系","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fub.2026.100225","t":"Ammonia-Mediated Energy Storage: Electrochemical Pathways","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fub.2026.100225","s":"Future Batteries","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia-mediated energy storage system offers a promising approach to bridging intermittent renewable electricity generation and dispatchable power supply through an integrated electricity–ammonia–electricity cycle. In this system, renewable electricity is first converted into ammonia via power-to-ammonia (P2A) conversion, stored and transported as a chemical energy carrier, and then reconverted into electricity via ammonia-to-power (A2P) technologies. This review discusses the ammonia-mediated energy storage system from an electrochemical perspective, covering both P2A and A2P conversions. For P2A, renewable hydrogen-assisted Haber–Bosch synthesis is considered the most technologically mature route for practical deployment, while emerging electrochemical nitrogen and nitrate reduction pathways are examined in terms of their potential and limitations. For A2P, indirect configurations cou","au":["Wenzhi Li","Lizhen Wu","Qing Wang","Guangrong Deng","Zhihao Zhao","Shu Yuan"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氨介导储能：电化学途径","zb":"该综述探讨了利用氨介导储能系统连接间歇性可再生能源发电与可调度电力供应的电化学途径。文章分析了电化学氮和硝酸盐还原路径在电转氨（P2A）中的潜力与局限，并对比了氨裂解耦合氢燃料电池与氨 fed 固体氧化物燃料电池（NH₃-SOFCs）及阴离子交换膜直接氨燃料电池（AEM-DAFCs）在电转电（A2P）中的进展。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.151910","t":"A multi-functional antibacterial film based on lignocellulose nanofibril and sodium alginate: ammonia sensing and fresh shrimp preservation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.151910","s":"Food Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jiyuan Shi","Dan Huo","Xin Tian","Qingqing Jian","Fengshan Zhang","Guigan Fang"],"o":"日常","zt":"基于木质纤维素纳米纤维和海藻酸钠的多功能抗菌膜：氨传感和新鲜虾保鲜","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ecmx.2026.102431","t":"Screening of recyclable metal candidates as solid carriers for production and storage of hydrogen and ammonia in solar chemical-looping processes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ecmx.2026.102431","s":"Energy Conversion and Management: X","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-02T02:28:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The potential of various metal oxides as redox carrier materials was investigated for on-demand hydrogen/ammonia production and solid-state storage through solar chemical-looping processes. Metal production involves solar-driven reduction assisted by various bio-sourced reductants, while nitride synthesis requires a similar reduction process supplemented by nitrogen incorporation. The reduced metals act as long-term solid storage media. Steam oxidation of metals (or nitrides) produces pure H 2 (or NH 3 ). A selection of oxide/metal and oxide/nitride pairs was carried out to identify the most promising systems. Suitable metals were screened according to multi-criteria: thermodynamic feasibility/conversion extents at equilibrium, cycle/process efficiencies, energy/exergy demands, specific storage density, and material availability/cost. Mo, W, and V offer high volumetric H 2 storage densit","au":["Stéphane Abanades","Srirat Chuayboon"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"太阳能化学链过程中用于生产与存储氢气和氨气的可回收金属载体候选物的筛选","zb":"本研究调查了各种金属氧化物作为太阳能化学链过程红载体的潜力，筛选了氧化物/金属和氧化物/氮化物对。根据热力学可行性、循环效率、能量/㶲需求和材料可获得性等标准，筛选出Mo、W、V具有高体积氢存储密度，而Al、Si、Mg、Fe、Mn、Cr、Ti平衡了存储性能与可获得性。对于氨气合成，AlN、TaN、ZrN、W₂N、TiN和Ge₃N₄的形成在热力学上是可行的。能量和㶲分析显示，Fe(s)、Mo(s)、Sn(s)、W(s)系统具有最高的太阳能-燃料效率（40–50%）。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.checir.2026.100204","t":"When catalytic partners fail to cooperate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checir.2026.100204","s":"Chem Circularity","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Combining catalytic sites with complementary functions has emerged as an appealing strategy for electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia. In Cell Reports Physical Science , Noor et al. demonstrate that complementary catalytic functions alone are insufficient to achieve synergistic nitrate reduction, highlighting the critical roles of active-site stability and spatial organization.","au":["Yang Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"当催化伙伴无法合作时","zb":"将具有互补功能的催化位点结合起来的策略已成为电化学硝酸盐还原为氨的一种吸引人的策略。在 Cell Reports Physical Science 中，Noor 等人证明，仅具有互补催化功能不足以实现协同硝酸盐还原，突出了活性位点稳定性和空间组织的关键作用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.084","t":"Low-MXene-loading ZnO/Ti3C2Tx nanocomposites for highly selective room-temperature ammonia sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.084","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-10T04:37:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jian-Fu Tang","Yu-Shrng Hsiao","Yen-Han Lai","Chung-Yuan Yang","Cheng-Liang Hsu"],"o":"日常","zt":"低 MXene 负载 ZnO/Ti3C2Tx 纳米复合材料用于高选择性室温氨气传感","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.043","t":"Effect of Rapid Joule-Heating Sintering on Densification and Grain Growth of SiC Ceramics","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.043","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-08T02:26:12Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Chaofan He","Yuhong Chen","Jiwei Ma","Wanxiu Hai","Meiling Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳热烧结对 SiC 陶瓷致密化和晶粒生长的影响","ob":"焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1007/s10854-026-18858-6","t":"Ammonia gas sensing and electromagnetic shielding characteristics of Ni-doped ZnO and Zn-doped NiO thin films deposited on PES fabrics via sol–gel method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10854-026-18858-6","s":"Journal of Materials Science: Materials in Electronics","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Enes Nayman"],"o":"日常","zt":"PES织物上通过溶胶-凝胶法制备的Ni掺杂ZnO和Zn掺杂NiO薄膜的氨气传感与电磁屏蔽特性","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.71144","t":"Electrocatalytic Dilute Nitric Oxide Reduction to Ammonia: From Interfacial Regulation to Reactor Engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.71144","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Nitric oxide (NO), a major atmospheric pollutant emitted from fossil‐fuel combustion and industrial processes, poses serious risks to both ecosystems and human health. At the same time, ammonia (NH 3 ) is an essential chemical feedstock and energy carrier, although its conventional production relies on energy‐intensive Haber–Bosch synthesis. Compared with nitrogen reduction, nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR) benefits from the intrinsic reactivity and higher solubility of NO molecules. However, achieving efficient and selective NO‐to‐NH 3 conversion remains challenging due to complex reaction pathways, competitive hydrogen evolution, and limited NO availability under ppm‐scale dilute feeds relevant to practical environments. In this review, we provide an overview of recent progress in NORR, covering mechanistic understanding, catalyst design, electrolyte engineering, and rea","au":["Zi‐Han Zhang","Bei Wu","Wan‐Ying Luo","Yao‐Yin Lou"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"电催化稀硝酸氧化物还原到氨：从界面调控到反应器工程","zb":"一氧化氮（NO）是化石燃料燃烧和工业过程中排放的主要大气污染物，对生态系统和人类健康构成严重风险。同时，氨（NH3）是一种重要的化学原料和能源载体，尽管其传统生产依赖于能耗高的哈伯-博施合成。与氮还原相比，一氧化氮还原反应（NORR）受益于 NO 分子的固有反应性和更高的溶解度。然而，由于复杂的反应路径、竞争性的析氢反应以及在实际环境中与 ppm 尺度稀释原料相关的有限 NO 可用性，实现高效和选择性的 NO 到 NH3 转化仍然具有挑战性。在本综述中，我们概述了 NORR 的最新进展，涵盖了机理理解、催化剂设计、电解质工程和反应器优化。特别关注调节界面微环境和在环境相关的 ppm 尺度 NO 条件下提高性能的策略。最后，我们讨论了仍然阻碍实际应用的主要障碍，并概述了开发高效和可扩展的 NORR 系统以实现实际 NO 治理和可持续 NH3 电合成的未来方向。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/asia.71047","t":"Electronic Effect and Key Intermediates in Electrochemical Ammonia Oxidation With Mn–Salen Complexes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/asia.71047","s":"Chemistry – An Asian Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-08T17:04:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia (NH 3 ) has emerged as a promising carbon‐free fuel and hydrogen carrier, offering a potential solution to meet growing global energy demands. In this study, we investigate the role of ligand electronic effects in a series of Mn–salen electrocatalysts for the ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) in nonaqueous media. Our results reveal that electron‐withdrawing substituents promote an earlier onset potential and enhanced catalytic activity. A high‐valent nitrido‐manganese (V) salen species is identified as a key reaction intermediate through mass spectrometry during electrolysis, which undergoes nucleophilic attack by NH 3 under oxidative conditions to produce nitrogen (N 2 ). We also examined how solvent and electron‐transfer redox mediators affect the reaction. While the solvent shows no significant impact on catalytic performance, the use of a mediator markedly enhances re","au":["Akanksha Negi","Anindita Bhar","Shiwangi Singh","Biswajit Mondal"],"o":"日常","zt":"配体电子效应对 Mn–Salen 配合物电化学氨氧化反应中的电子效应和关键中间体的研究","zb":"研究对象为非水介质中 Mn–Salen 电催化剂对氨氧化反应 (AOR) 的催化性能。通过质谱分析电解过程中的高价氮-锰 (V) salen 物种作为关键反应中间体，发现吸电子取代基促进起始电位降低和催化活性增强。溶剂和电子转移氧化还原介质对反应有影响，其中介质显著提高反应动力学。在水中 AOR 表现出 1.65 V 的起始电位，以及 93.6% ± 4.5% 的 N2 选择性和 98.9% ± 1.7% 的 H2 选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"}]);
